#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!datetime` --- Basic date and time types"
msgstr ":mod:`!datetime` --- 日期與時間的基本型別"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/datetime.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/datetime.py`"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!datetime` module supplies classes for manipulating dates and "
"times."
msgstr ":mod:`!datetime` 模組提供操作日期與時間的類別。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:13
msgid ""
"While date and time arithmetic is supported, the focus of the implementation "
"is on efficient attribute extraction for output formatting and manipulation."
msgstr ""
"雖然支援日期與時間的運算，但實作的重點在於有效率地擷取屬性，以用於輸出格式化"
"與操作。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:18
msgid "Skip to :ref:`the format codes <format-codes>`."
msgstr "跳轉至\\ :ref:`格式碼 (format codes) <format-codes>`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:22
msgid "Module :mod:`calendar`"
msgstr ":mod:`calendar` 模組"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:23
msgid "General calendar related functions."
msgstr "與日曆相關的一般函式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:25
msgid "Module :mod:`time`"
msgstr ":mod:`time` 模組"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:26
msgid "Time access and conversions."
msgstr "時間的存取與轉換。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:28
msgid "Module :mod:`zoneinfo`"
msgstr ":mod:`zoneinfo` 模組"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:29
msgid "Concrete time zones representing the IANA time zone database."
msgstr "代表 IANA 時區資料庫的具體時區。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:31
msgid "Package `dateutil <https://dateutil.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_"
msgstr "`dateutil <https://dateutil.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_ 套件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:32
msgid "Third-party library with expanded time zone and parsing support."
msgstr "帶有時區與剖析擴充支援的第三方函式庫。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:34
msgid "Package :pypi:`DateType`"
msgstr ":pypi:`DateType` 套件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:35
msgid ""
"Third-party library that introduces distinct static types to for example, "
"allow :term:`static type checkers <static type checker>` to differentiate "
"between naive and aware datetimes."
msgstr ""
"引進不同靜態型別的第三方函式庫，例如可讓\\ :term:`靜態型別檢查器 <static "
"type checker>`\\ 區分 naive 與 aware 的 datetime。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:43
msgid "Aware and naive objects"
msgstr "aware 與 naive 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:45
msgid ""
"Date and time objects may be categorized as \"aware\" or \"naive\" depending "
"on whether or not they include time zone information."
msgstr "日期與時間物件可以依據是否包含時區資訊，分為「aware」或「naive」兩類。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:48
msgid ""
"With sufficient knowledge of applicable algorithmic and political time "
"adjustments, such as time zone and daylight saving time information, an "
"**aware** object can locate itself relative to other aware objects. An aware "
"object represents a specific moment in time that is not open to "
"interpretation. [#]_"
msgstr ""
"只要充分掌握適用的演算上與政治上的時間調整（例如時區與日光節約時間資訊），"
"**aware** 物件就能確定自己相對於其他 aware 物件的位置。aware 物件代表一個明確"
"的時間點，沒有任何解讀的空間 [#]_。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:54
msgid ""
"A **naive** object does not contain enough information to unambiguously "
"locate itself relative to other date/time objects. Whether a naive object "
"represents Coordinated Universal Time (UTC), local time, or time in some "
"other time zone is purely up to the program, just like it is up to the "
"program whether a particular number represents metres, miles, or mass. Naive "
"objects are easy to understand and to work with, at the cost of ignoring "
"some aspects of reality."
msgstr ""
"**naive** 物件沒有足夠的資訊來明確地確定自己相對於其他日期/時間物件的位置。一"
"個 naive 物件代表的是世界協調時間 (UTC)、本地時間還是其他時區的時間，完全由程"
"式決定，就像一個特定數字代表的是公尺、英里還是質量，也是由程式決定。naive 物"
"件容易理解和使用，代價是忽略了現實中的某些面向。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:61
msgid ""
"For applications requiring aware objects, :class:`.datetime` and :class:`."
"time` objects have an optional time zone information attribute, :attr:`!"
"tzinfo`, that can be set to an instance of a subclass of the abstract :class:"
"`!tzinfo` class. These :class:`tzinfo` objects capture information about the "
"offset from UTC time, the time zone name, and whether daylight saving time "
"is in effect."
msgstr ""
"對於需要 aware 物件的應用程式，:class:`.datetime` 與 :class:`.time` 物件有一"
"個選用的時區資訊屬性 :attr:`!tzinfo`，可以設定為抽象類別 :class:`!tzinfo` 的"
"子類別實例。這些 :class:`tzinfo` 物件會記錄與 UTC 時間的偏移量、時區名稱，以"
"及日光節約時間是否生效等資訊。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:67
msgid ""
"Only one concrete :class:`tzinfo` class, the :class:`timezone` class, is "
"supplied by the :mod:`!datetime` module. The :class:`!timezone` class can "
"represent simple time zones with fixed offsets from UTC, such as UTC itself "
"or North American EST and EDT time zones. Supporting time zones at deeper "
"levels of detail is up to the application. The rules for time adjustment "
"across the world are more political than rational, change frequently, and "
"there is no standard suitable for every application aside from UTC."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!datetime` 模組只提供一個具體的 :class:`tzinfo` 類別，也就是 :class:"
"`timezone` 類別。:class:`!timezone` 類別可以表示與 UTC 有固定偏移量的簡單時"
"區，例如 UTC 本身或北美的 EST 與 EDT 時區。要支援更細緻的時區則由應用程式自行"
"處理。世界各地的時間調整規則與其說合乎理性，不如說更受政治左右，而且經常變"
"動；除了 UTC 之外，並沒有適用於所有應用程式的標準。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:77
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:79
msgid "The :mod:`!datetime` module exports the following constants:"
msgstr ":mod:`!datetime` 模組匯出以下常數："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:83
msgid ""
"The smallest year number allowed in a :class:`date` or :class:`.datetime` "
"object. :const:`MINYEAR` is 1."
msgstr ""
":class:`date` 或 :class:`.datetime` 物件中允許的最小年份。:const:`MINYEAR` "
"為 1。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:89
msgid ""
"The largest year number allowed in a :class:`date` or :class:`.datetime` "
"object. :const:`MAXYEAR` is 9999."
msgstr ""
":class:`date` 或 :class:`.datetime` 物件中允許的最大年份。:const:`MAXYEAR` "
"為 9999。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:95
msgid "Alias for the UTC time zone singleton :attr:`datetime.timezone.utc`."
msgstr "UTC 時區單例 (singleton) :attr:`datetime.timezone.utc` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:101
msgid "Available types"
msgstr "可用的型別"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:106
msgid ""
"An idealized naive date, assuming the current Gregorian calendar always was, "
"and always will be, in effect. Attributes: :attr:`year`, :attr:`month`, and :"
"attr:`day`."
msgstr ""
"一個理想化的 naive 日期，假設目前的公曆 (Gregorian calendar) 過去一直有效、未"
"來也將永遠有效。屬性：:attr:`year`、:attr:`month` 與 :attr:`day`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:114
msgid ""
"An idealized time, independent of any particular day, assuming that every "
"day has exactly 24\\*60\\*60 seconds.  (There is no notion of \"leap "
"seconds\" here.) Attributes: :attr:`hour`, :attr:`minute`, :attr:`second`, :"
"attr:`microsecond`, and :attr:`.tzinfo`."
msgstr ""
"一個理想化的時間，與任何特定日期無關，並假設每天剛好有 24\\*60\\*60 秒（這裡"
"沒有「閏秒」的概念）。屬性：:attr:`hour`、:attr:`minute`、:attr:`second`、:"
"attr:`microsecond` 與 :attr:`.tzinfo`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:123
msgid ""
"A combination of a date and a time. Attributes: :attr:`year`, :attr:"
"`month`, :attr:`day`, :attr:`hour`, :attr:`minute`, :attr:`second`, :attr:"
"`microsecond`, and :attr:`.tzinfo`."
msgstr ""
"日期與時間的組合。屬性：:attr:`year`、:attr:`month`、:attr:`day`、:attr:"
"`hour`、:attr:`minute`、:attr:`second`、:attr:`microsecond` 與 :attr:`."
"tzinfo`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:131
msgid ""
"A duration expressing the difference between two :class:`.datetime` or :"
"class:`date` instances to microsecond resolution."
msgstr ""
"表示兩個 :class:`.datetime` 或 :class:`date` 實例之間時間的差異，以微秒為解析"
"度。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:138
msgid ""
"An abstract base class for time zone information objects. These are used by "
"the :class:`.datetime` and :class:`.time` classes to provide a customizable "
"notion of time adjustment (for example, to account for time zone and/or "
"daylight saving time)."
msgstr ""
"時區資訊物件的抽象基底類別。:class:`.datetime` 與 :class:`.time` 類別會使用它"
"們來提供可自訂的時間調整概念（例如處理時區和/或日光節約時間）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:147
msgid ""
"A class that implements the :class:`tzinfo` abstract base class as a fixed "
"offset from the UTC."
msgstr "一個實作 :class:`tzinfo` 抽象基底類別的類別，表示與 UTC 的固定偏移量。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:153 ../../library/datetime.rst:170
msgid "Objects of these types are immutable."
msgstr "這些型別的物件是不可變的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:155
msgid "Subclass relationships:"
msgstr "子類別關係："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:157
msgid ""
"timedelta, tzinfo, time, and date inherit from object; timezone inherits\n"
"from tzinfo; and datetime inherits from date."
msgstr ""
"timedelta、tzinfo、time 與 date 繼承自 object；timezone 繼承\n"
"自 tzinfo；而 datetime 繼承自 date。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:165
msgid "Common properties"
msgstr "常見屬性"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:167
msgid ""
"The :class:`date`, :class:`.datetime`, :class:`.time`, and :class:`timezone` "
"types share these common features:"
msgstr ""
":class:`date`、:class:`.datetime`、:class:`.time` 與 :class:`timezone` 型別具"
"有以下共同特性："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:171
msgid ""
"Objects of these types are :term:`hashable`, meaning that they can be used "
"as dictionary keys."
msgstr ""
"這些型別的物件是\\ :term:`可雜湊的 <hashable>`，這表示它們可以作為字典的鍵。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:173
msgid ""
"Objects of these types support efficient pickling via the :mod:`pickle` "
"module."
msgstr "這些型別的物件支援透過 :mod:`pickle` 模組進行高效率的封裝 (pickling)。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:177
msgid "Determining if an object is aware or naive"
msgstr "判斷物件是 aware 還是 naive"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:179
msgid "Objects of the :class:`date` type are always naive."
msgstr ":class:`date` 型別的物件一律是 naive 的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:181
msgid ""
"An object of type :class:`.time` or :class:`.datetime` may be aware or naive."
msgstr ""
":class:`.time` 或 :class:`.datetime` 型別的物件可能是 aware 或 naive 的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:183
msgid ""
"A :class:`.datetime` object ``d`` is aware if :meth:`d.utcoffset() <datetime."
"utcoffset>` does not return ``None``. Otherwise, ``d`` is naive."
msgstr ""
"如果 :meth:`d.utcoffset() <datetime.utcoffset>` 沒有回傳 ``None``，則 :class:"
"`.datetime` 物件 ``d`` 是 aware 的。否則 ``d`` 會是 naive 的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:187
msgid ""
"A :class:`.time` object ``t`` is aware if :meth:`t.utcoffset() <time."
"utcoffset>` does not return ``None``. Otherwise, ``t`` is naive."
msgstr ""
"如果 :meth:`t.utcoffset() <time.utcoffset>` 沒有回傳 ``None``，則 :class:`."
"time` 物件 ``t`` 是 aware 的。否則 ``t`` 會是 naive 的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:191
msgid ""
"The distinction between aware and naive doesn't apply to :class:`timedelta` "
"objects."
msgstr "aware 與 naive 的區別不適用於 :class:`timedelta` 物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:198
msgid ":class:`!timedelta` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!timedelta` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:200
msgid ""
"A :class:`timedelta` object represents a duration, the difference between "
"two :class:`.datetime` or :class:`date` instances."
msgstr ""
"一個 :class:`timedelta` 物件代表著一段持續時間，即兩個 :class:`.datetime` "
"或 :class:`date` 之間的差異。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:205
msgid ""
"All arguments are optional and default to 0. Arguments may be integers or "
"floats, and may be positive or negative."
msgstr ""
"所有引數都是選用的，預設為 0。引數可以是整數或浮點數，也可以是正數或負數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:208
msgid ""
"Only *days*, *seconds* and *microseconds* are stored internally. Arguments "
"are converted to those units:"
msgstr ""
"內部只會儲存 *days*、*seconds* 與 *microseconds*。引數會被轉換為這些單位："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:211
msgid "A millisecond is converted to 1000 microseconds."
msgstr "一毫秒會被轉換為 1000 微秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:212
msgid "A minute is converted to 60 seconds."
msgstr "一分鐘會被轉換為 60 秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:213
msgid "An hour is converted to 3600 seconds."
msgstr "一小時會被轉換為 3600 秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:214
msgid "A week is converted to 7 days."
msgstr "一週會被轉換為 7 天。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:216
msgid ""
"and days, seconds and microseconds are then normalized so that the "
"representation is unique, with"
msgstr ""
"接著再將 days、seconds 與 microseconds 正規化，讓表示方式是唯一的，其中"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:219
msgid "``0 <= microseconds < 1000000``"
msgstr "``0 <= microseconds < 1000000``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:220
msgid "``0 <= seconds < 3600*24`` (the number of seconds in one day)"
msgstr "``0 <= seconds < 3600*24``\\ （一天的秒數）"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:221
msgid "``-999999999 <= days <= 999999999``"
msgstr "``-999999999 <= days <= 999999999``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:223
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates how any arguments besides *days*, "
"*seconds* and *microseconds* are \"merged\" and normalized into those three "
"resulting attributes::"
msgstr ""
"以下範例說明 *days*、*seconds* 與 *microseconds* 以外的引數如何被「合併」並正"
"規化為最終的這三個屬性： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:227
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> delta = dt.timedelta(\n"
"...     days=50,\n"
"...     seconds=27,\n"
"...     microseconds=10,\n"
"...     milliseconds=29000,\n"
"...     minutes=5,\n"
"...     hours=8,\n"
"...     weeks=2\n"
"... )\n"
">>> # Only days, seconds, and microseconds remain\n"
">>> delta\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=64, seconds=29156, microseconds=10)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> delta = dt.timedelta(\n"
"...     days=50,\n"
"...     seconds=27,\n"
"...     microseconds=10,\n"
"...     milliseconds=29000,\n"
"...     minutes=5,\n"
"...     hours=8,\n"
"...     weeks=2\n"
"... )\n"
">>> # 只剩下 days、seconds 與 microseconds\n"
">>> delta\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=64, seconds=29156, microseconds=10)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:242
msgid ""
"``import datetime as dt`` instead of ``import datetime`` or ``from datetime "
"import datetime`` to avoid confusion between the module and the class. See "
"`How I Import Python’s datetime Module <https://adamj.eu/tech/2019/09/12/how-"
"i-import-pythons-datetime-module/>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``import datetime as dt`` 而非 ``import datetime`` 或 ``from datetime "
"import datetime``，以避免混淆模組與類別。請參閱 `How I Import Python’s "
"datetime Module <https://adamj.eu/tech/2019/09/12/how-i-import-pythons-"
"datetime-module/>`__。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:247
msgid ""
"If any argument is a float and there are fractional microseconds, the "
"fractional microseconds left over from all arguments are combined and their "
"sum is rounded to the nearest microsecond using round-half-to-even "
"tiebreaker. If no argument is a float, the conversion and normalization "
"processes are exact (no information is lost)."
msgstr ""
"如果有任何引數是浮點數且帶有小數部分的微秒，則所有引數剩餘的小數微秒會被合"
"併，並以奇進偶捨 (round-half-to-even) 的規則將總和捨入到最接近的微秒。如果沒"
"有任何引數是浮點數，則轉換與正規化的過程都是精確的（不會遺失任何資訊）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:254
msgid ""
"If the normalized value of days lies outside the indicated range, :exc:"
"`OverflowError` is raised."
msgstr "如果正規化後的 days 值超出指定的範圍，則會引發 :exc:`OverflowError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:257
msgid ""
"Note that normalization of negative values may be surprising at first. For "
"example::"
msgstr "請注意，負值的正規化結果一開始可能會令人意外。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:260
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.timedelta(microseconds=-1)\n"
">>> (d.days, d.seconds, d.microseconds)\n"
"(-1, 86399, 999999)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.timedelta(microseconds=-1)\n"
">>> (d.days, d.seconds, d.microseconds)\n"
"(-1, 86399, 999999)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:265
msgid ""
"Since the string representation of :class:`!timedelta` objects can be "
"confusing, use the following recipe to produce a more readable format:"
msgstr ""
"由於 :class:`!timedelta` 物件的字串表示可能令人困惑，可以使用以下做法來產生更"
"易讀的格式："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:268
msgid ""
">>> def pretty_timedelta(td):\n"
"...     if td.days >= 0:\n"
"...         return str(td)\n"
"...     return f'-({-td!s})'\n"
"...\n"
">>> d = timedelta(hours=-1)\n"
">>> str(d)  # not human-friendly\n"
"'-1 day, 23:00:00'\n"
">>> pretty_timedelta(d)\n"
"'-(1:00:00)'"
msgstr ""
">>> def pretty_timedelta(td):\n"
"...     if td.days >= 0:\n"
"...         return str(td)\n"
"...     return f'-({-td!s})'\n"
"...\n"
">>> d = timedelta(hours=-1)\n"
">>> str(d)  # not human-friendly\n"
"'-1 day, 23:00:00'\n"
">>> pretty_timedelta(d)\n"
"'-(1:00:00)'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:282 ../../library/datetime.rst:622
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1195 ../../library/datetime.rst:1844
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2480
msgid "Class attributes:"
msgstr "類別屬性："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:286
msgid "The most negative :class:`timedelta` object, ``timedelta(-999999999)``."
msgstr "最小（最負）的 :class:`timedelta` 物件，``timedelta(-999999999)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:291
msgid ""
"The most positive :class:`timedelta` object, ``timedelta(days=999999999, "
"hours=23, minutes=59, seconds=59, microseconds=999999)``."
msgstr ""
"最大（最正）的 :class:`timedelta` 物件，``timedelta(days=999999999, "
"hours=23, minutes=59, seconds=59, microseconds=999999)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:297
msgid ""
"The smallest possible difference between non-equal :class:`timedelta` "
"objects, ``timedelta(microseconds=1)``."
msgstr ""
"不相等的 :class:`timedelta` 物件之間可能的最小差值，"
"``timedelta(microseconds=1)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:301
msgid ""
"Note that, because of normalization, ``timedelta.max`` is greater than ``-"
"timedelta.min``. ``-timedelta.max`` is not representable as a :class:"
"`timedelta` object."
msgstr ""
"請注意，由於正規化的緣故，``timedelta.max`` 大於 ``-timedelta.min``。``-"
"timedelta.max`` 無法以 :class:`timedelta` 物件表示。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:305 ../../library/datetime.rst:640
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1215 ../../library/datetime.rst:1864
msgid "Instance attributes (read-only):"
msgstr "實例屬性（唯讀）："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:309
msgid "Between -999,999,999 and 999,999,999 inclusive."
msgstr "在 -999,999,999 到 999,999,999 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:314
msgid "Between 0 and 86,399 inclusive."
msgstr "在 0 到 86,399 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:318
msgid ""
"It is a somewhat common bug for code to unintentionally use this attribute "
"when it is actually intended to get a :meth:`~timedelta.total_seconds` value "
"instead:"
msgstr ""
"一個還算常見的錯誤是程式碼無意間使用了這個屬性，但實際上想取得的是 :meth:"
"`~timedelta.total_seconds` 的值："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:322
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> duration = dt.timedelta(seconds=11235813)\n"
">>> duration.days, duration.seconds\n"
"(130, 3813)\n"
">>> duration.total_seconds()\n"
"11235813.0"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> duration = dt.timedelta(seconds=11235813)\n"
">>> duration.days, duration.seconds\n"
"(130, 3813)\n"
">>> duration.total_seconds()\n"
"11235813.0"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:334
msgid "Between 0 and 999,999 inclusive."
msgstr "在 0 到 999,999 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:337 ../../library/datetime.rst:657
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1269
msgid "Supported operations:"
msgstr "支援的運算："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:340 ../../library/datetime.rst:660
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1272
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "運算"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:340 ../../library/datetime.rst:660
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1272
msgid "Result"
msgstr "結果"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:342
msgid "``t1 = t2 + t3``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 + t3``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:342
msgid ""
"Sum of ``t2`` and ``t3``. Afterwards ``t1 - t2 == t3`` and ``t1 - t3 == t2`` "
"are true. (1)"
msgstr ""
"``t2`` 與 ``t3`` 的和。運算後 ``t1 - t2 == t3`` 與 ``t1 - t3 == t2`` 為真。 "
"(1)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:346
msgid "``t1 = t2 - t3``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 - t3``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:346
msgid ""
"Difference of ``t2``  and ``t3``. Afterwards ``t1 == t2 - t3`` and ``t2 == "
"t1 + t3`` are true. (1)(6)"
msgstr ""
"``t2`` 與 ``t3`` 的差。運算後 ``t1 == t2 - t3`` 與 ``t2 == t1 + t3`` 為真。 "
"(1)(6)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:350
msgid "``t1 = t2 * i or t1 = i * t2``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 * i or t1 = i * t2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:350
msgid ""
"Delta multiplied by an integer. Afterwards ``t1 // i == t2`` is true, "
"provided ``i != 0``."
msgstr ""
"時間差乘以一個整數。運算後，只要 ``i != 0``，``t1 // i == t2`` 即為真。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:354
msgid "In general, ``t1  * i == t1 * (i-1) + t1`` is true. (1)"
msgstr "一般而言，``t1  * i == t1 * (i-1) + t1`` 為真。 (1)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:357
msgid "``t1 = t2 * f or t1 = f * t2``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 * f or t1 = f * t2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:357
msgid ""
"Delta multiplied by a float. The result is rounded to the nearest multiple "
"of timedelta.resolution using round-half-to-even."
msgstr ""
"時間差乘以一個浮點數。結果會以奇進偶捨的規則捨入到 timedelta.resolution 最接"
"近的倍數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:361
msgid "``f = t2 / t3``"
msgstr "``f = t2 / t3``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:361
msgid ""
"Division (3) of overall duration ``t2`` by interval unit ``t3``. Returns a :"
"class:`float` object."
msgstr ""
"除法 (3)：將總持續時間 ``t2`` 除以間隔單位 ``t3``。回傳一個 :class:`float` 物"
"件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:365
msgid "``t1 = t2 / f or t1 = t2 / i``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 / f or t1 = t2 / i``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:365
msgid ""
"Delta divided by a float or an int. The result is rounded to the nearest "
"multiple of timedelta.resolution using round-half-to-even."
msgstr ""
"時間差除以一個浮點數或整數。結果會以奇進偶捨的規則捨入到 timedelta."
"resolution 最接近的倍數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:369
msgid "``t1 = t2 // i`` or ``t1 = t2 // t3``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 // i`` or ``t1 = t2 // t3``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:369
msgid ""
"The floor is computed and the remainder (if any) is thrown away. In the "
"second case, an integer is returned. (3)"
msgstr ""
"計算向下取整的結果，並捨棄餘數（如果有的話）。在第二種情況下會回傳一個整數。 "
"(3)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:373
msgid "``t1 = t2 % t3``"
msgstr "``t1 = t2 % t3``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:373
msgid "The remainder is computed as a :class:`timedelta` object. (3)"
msgstr "餘數會以 :class:`timedelta` 物件的形式計算。 (3)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:376
msgid "``q, r = divmod(t1, t2)``"
msgstr "``q, r = divmod(t1, t2)``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:376
msgid ""
"Computes the quotient and the remainder: ``q = t1 // t2`` (3) and ``r = t1 % "
"t2``. ``q`` is an integer and ``r`` is a :class:`timedelta` object."
msgstr ""
"計算商與餘數：``q = t1 // t2`` (3) 與 ``r = t1 % t2``。``q`` 是一個整數，而 "
"``r`` 是一個 :class:`timedelta` 物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:381
msgid "``+t1``"
msgstr "``+t1``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:381
msgid "Returns a :class:`timedelta` object with the same value. (2)"
msgstr "回傳一個具有相同值的 :class:`timedelta` 物件。 (2)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:384
msgid "``-t1``"
msgstr "``-t1``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:384
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``timedelta(-t1.days, -t1.seconds, -t1.microseconds)``, and to "
"``t1 * -1``. (1)(4)"
msgstr ""
"等價於 ``timedelta(-t1.days, -t1.seconds, -t1.microseconds)``，也等價於 ``t1 "
"* -1``。 (1)(4)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:388
msgid "``abs(t)``"
msgstr "``abs(t)``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:388
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``+t`` when ``t.days >= 0``, and to ``-t`` when ``t.days < "
"0``. (2)"
msgstr ""
"當 ``t.days >= 0`` 時等價於 ``+t``，當 ``t.days < 0`` 時等價於 ``-t``。 (2)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:391
msgid "``str(t)``"
msgstr "``str(t)``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:391
msgid ""
"Returns a string in the form ``[D day[s], ][H]H:MM:SS[.UUUUUU]``, where D is "
"negative for negative ``t``. (5)"
msgstr ""
"回傳 ``[D day[s], ][H]H:MM:SS[.UUUUUU]`` 形式的字串，其中當 ``t`` 為負時 D 為"
"負數。 (5)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:395
msgid "``repr(t)``"
msgstr "``repr(t)``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:395
msgid ""
"Returns a string representation of the :class:`timedelta` object as a "
"constructor call with canonical attribute values."
msgstr ""
"以帶有標準形式屬性值的建構函式呼叫，回傳 :class:`timedelta` 物件的字串表示。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:400 ../../library/datetime.rst:679
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2797
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "註解："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:403
msgid "This is exact but may overflow."
msgstr "這是精確的，但可能會溢位。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:406
msgid "This is exact and cannot overflow."
msgstr "這是精確的，且不會溢位。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:409
msgid "Division by zero raises :exc:`ZeroDivisionError`."
msgstr "除以零會引發 :exc:`ZeroDivisionError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:412
msgid "``-timedelta.max`` is not representable as a :class:`timedelta` object."
msgstr "``-timedelta.max`` 無法以 :class:`timedelta` 物件表示。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:415
msgid ""
"String representations of :class:`timedelta` objects are normalized "
"similarly to their internal representation. This leads to somewhat unusual "
"results for negative timedeltas. For example::"
msgstr ""
":class:`timedelta` 物件的字串表示會以類似其內部表示的方式正規化。這會使負的 "
"timedelta 產生有些不尋常的結果。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:419
msgid ""
">>> timedelta(hours=-5)\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=-1, seconds=68400)\n"
">>> print(_)\n"
"-1 day, 19:00:00"
msgstr ""
">>> timedelta(hours=-5)\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=-1, seconds=68400)\n"
">>> print(_)\n"
"-1 day, 19:00:00"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:425
msgid ""
"The expression ``t2 - t3`` will always be equal to the expression ``t2 + (-"
"t3)`` except when t3 is equal to ``timedelta.max``; in that case the former "
"will produce a result while the latter will overflow."
msgstr ""
"運算式 ``t2 - t3`` 永遠等於運算式 ``t2 + (-t3)``，除非 t3 等於 ``timedelta."
"max``；在這種情況下，前者會產生結果，而後者會溢位。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:429
msgid ""
"In addition to the operations listed above, :class:`timedelta` objects "
"support certain additions and subtractions with :class:`date` and :class:`."
"datetime` objects (see below)."
msgstr ""
"除了上面列出的運算之外，:class:`timedelta` 物件還支援與 :class:`date` 和 :"
"class:`.datetime` 物件進行某些加法與減法運算（見下文）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:433
msgid ""
"Floor division and true division of a :class:`timedelta` object by another :"
"class:`!timedelta` object are now supported, as are remainder operations and "
"the :func:`divmod` function. True division and multiplication of a :class:`!"
"timedelta` object by a :class:`float` object are now supported."
msgstr ""
"現在支援以另一個 :class:`!timedelta` 物件對 :class:`timedelta` 物件進行向下取"
"整除法與真除法，也支援取餘數運算與 :func:`divmod` 函式。現在也支援以 :class:"
"`float` 物件對 :class:`!timedelta` 物件進行真除法與乘法。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:439
msgid ":class:`timedelta` objects support equality and order comparisons."
msgstr ":class:`timedelta` 物件支援相等性比較與順序比較。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:441
msgid ""
"In Boolean contexts, a :class:`timedelta` object is considered to be true if "
"and only if it isn't equal to ``timedelta(0)``."
msgstr ""
"在布林情境中，:class:`timedelta` 物件若且唯若不等於 ``timedelta(0)`` 時才會被"
"視為真。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:444 ../../library/datetime.rst:721
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1360 ../../library/datetime.rst:1989
msgid "Instance methods:"
msgstr "實例方法："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:448
msgid ""
"Return the total number of seconds contained in the duration. Equivalent to "
"``td / timedelta(seconds=1)``. For interval units other than seconds, use "
"the division form directly (for example, ``td / timedelta(microseconds=1)``)."
msgstr ""
"回傳這段持續時間所包含的總秒數。等價於 ``td / timedelta(seconds=1)``。若要使"
"用秒以外的間隔單位，請直接使用除法的形式（例如 ``td / "
"timedelta(microseconds=1)``）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:452
msgid ""
"Note that for very large time intervals (greater than 270 years on most "
"platforms) this method will lose microsecond accuracy."
msgstr ""
"請注意，對於非常長的時間間隔（在大多數平台上大於 270 年），此方法會失去微秒等"
"級的準確度。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:459
msgid "Examples of usage: :class:`!timedelta`"
msgstr "用法範例：:class:`!timedelta`"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:461
msgid "An additional example of normalization::"
msgstr "另一個正規化的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:463
msgid ""
">>> # Components of another_year add up to exactly 365 days\n"
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> year = dt.timedelta(days=365)\n"
">>> another_year = dt.timedelta(weeks=40, days=84, hours=23,\n"
"...                             minutes=50, seconds=600)\n"
">>> year == another_year\n"
"True\n"
">>> year.total_seconds()\n"
"31536000.0"
msgstr ""
">>> # another_year 的各個組成加起來剛好是 365 天\n"
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> year = dt.timedelta(days=365)\n"
">>> another_year = dt.timedelta(weeks=40, days=84, hours=23,\n"
"...                             minutes=50, seconds=600)\n"
">>> year == another_year\n"
"True\n"
">>> year.total_seconds()\n"
"31536000.0"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:473
msgid "Examples of :class:`timedelta` arithmetic::"
msgstr ":class:`timedelta` 運算的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:475
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> year = dt.timedelta(days=365)\n"
">>> ten_years = 10 * year\n"
">>> ten_years\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=3650)\n"
">>> ten_years.days // 365\n"
"10\n"
">>> nine_years = ten_years - year\n"
">>> nine_years\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=3285)\n"
">>> three_years = nine_years // 3\n"
">>> three_years, three_years.days // 365\n"
"(datetime.timedelta(days=1095), 3)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> year = dt.timedelta(days=365)\n"
">>> ten_years = 10 * year\n"
">>> ten_years\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=3650)\n"
">>> ten_years.days // 365\n"
"10\n"
">>> nine_years = ten_years - year\n"
">>> nine_years\n"
"datetime.timedelta(days=3285)\n"
">>> three_years = nine_years // 3\n"
">>> three_years, three_years.days // 365\n"
"(datetime.timedelta(days=1095), 3)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:493
msgid ":class:`!date` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!date` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:495
msgid ""
"A :class:`date` object represents a date (year, month and day) in an "
"idealized calendar, the current Gregorian calendar indefinitely extended in "
"both directions."
msgstr ""
":class:`date` 物件代表理想化曆法中的日期（年、月、日），也就是將目前的公曆往"
"前後兩個方向無限延伸。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:499
msgid ""
"January 1 of year 1 is called day number 1, January 2 of year 1 is called "
"day number 2, and so on. [#]_"
msgstr ""
"西元 1 年 1 月 1 日稱為第 1 天，西元 1 年 1 月 2 日稱為第 2 天，依此類推 "
"[#]_。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:504
msgid ""
"All arguments are required. Arguments must be integers, in the following "
"ranges:"
msgstr "所有引數都是必要的。引數必須是在以下範圍內的整數："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:507
msgid "``MINYEAR <= year <= MAXYEAR``"
msgstr "``MINYEAR <= year <= MAXYEAR``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:508
msgid "``1 <= month <= 12``"
msgstr "``1 <= month <= 12``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:509
msgid "``1 <= day <= number of days in the given month and year``"
msgstr "``1 <= day <= number of days in the given month and year``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:511 ../../library/datetime.rst:942
msgid ""
"If an argument outside those ranges is given, :exc:`ValueError` is raised."
msgstr "如果給定的引數超出這些範圍，會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:514 ../../library/datetime.rst:948
msgid "Other constructors, all class methods:"
msgstr "其他建構函式，皆為類別方法："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:518
msgid "Return the current local date."
msgstr "回傳目前的本地日期。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:520
msgid "This is equivalent to ``date.fromtimestamp(time.time())``."
msgstr "這等價於 ``date.fromtimestamp(time.time())``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:525
msgid ""
"Return the local date corresponding to the POSIX *timestamp*, such as is "
"returned by :func:`time.time`."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於 POSIX 時間戳記 *timestamp* 的本地日期，例如 :func:`time.time` 所回"
"傳的值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:528
msgid ""
"This may raise :exc:`OverflowError`, if the timestamp is out of the range of "
"values supported by the platform C :c:func:`localtime` function, and :exc:"
"`OSError` on :c:func:`localtime` failure. It's common for this to be "
"restricted to years from 1970 through 2038. Note that on non-POSIX systems "
"that include leap seconds in their notion of a timestamp, leap seconds are "
"ignored by :meth:`fromtimestamp`."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`localtime` 函式所支援的值範圍，可能會引發 :"
"exc:`OverflowError`；如果 :c:func:`localtime` 執行失敗，則會引發 :exc:"
"`OSError`。通常範圍會被限制在 1970 年到 2038 年之間。請注意，在時間戳記概念中"
"包含閏秒的非 POSIX 系統上，:meth:`fromtimestamp` 會忽略閏秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:535
msgid ""
"Raise :exc:`OverflowError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` if the timestamp is "
"out of the range of values supported by the platform C :c:func:`localtime` "
"function. Raise :exc:`OSError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` on :c:func:"
"`localtime` failure."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`localtime` 函式所支援的值範圍，會引發 :exc:"
"`OverflowError` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。:c:func:`localtime` 執行失敗時會引"
"發 :exc:`OSError` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:541 ../../library/datetime.rst:1036
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1076
msgid "Accepts any real number as *timestamp*, not only integer or float."
msgstr "接受任何實數作為 *timestamp*，而不僅限於整數或浮點數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:547
msgid ""
"Return the date corresponding to the proleptic Gregorian *ordinal*, where "
"January 1 of year 1 has ordinal 1."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於逆推公曆 (proleptic Gregorian) 序數 *ordinal* 的日期，其中西元 1 "
"年 1 月 1 日的序數為 1。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:550
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is raised unless ``1 <= ordinal <= date.max.toordinal()``. "
"For any date ``d``, ``date.fromordinal(d.toordinal()) == d``."
msgstr ""
"除非 ``1 <= ordinal <= date.max.toordinal()``，否則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"
"對於任何日期 ``d``，``date.fromordinal(d.toordinal()) == d``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:557
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`date` corresponding to a *date_string* given in any valid "
"ISO 8601 format, with the following exceptions:"
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於以任何有效 ISO 8601 格式給定之 *date_string* 的 :class:`date`，但有"
"以下例外："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:560 ../../library/datetime.rst:1117
msgid ""
"Reduced precision dates are not currently supported (``YYYY-MM``, ``YYYY``)."
msgstr "目前不支援降低精度的日期（``YYYY-MM``、``YYYY``）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:562 ../../library/datetime.rst:1119
msgid ""
"Extended date representations are not currently supported (``±YYYYYY-MM-"
"DD``)."
msgstr "目前不支援擴充的日期表示法（``±YYYYYY-MM-DD``）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:564 ../../library/datetime.rst:1121
msgid "Ordinal dates are not currently supported (``YYYY-OOO``)."
msgstr "目前不支援以年內序數表示的日期（``YYYY-OOO``）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:566 ../../library/datetime.rst:1123
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1598
msgid "Examples::"
msgstr "範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:568
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('2019-12-04')\n"
"datetime.date(2019, 12, 4)\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('20191204')\n"
"datetime.date(2019, 12, 4)\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('2021-W01-1')\n"
"datetime.date(2021, 1, 4)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('2019-12-04')\n"
"datetime.date(2019, 12, 4)\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('20191204')\n"
"datetime.date(2019, 12, 4)\n"
">>> dt.date.fromisoformat('2021-W01-1')\n"
"datetime.date(2021, 1, 4)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:577
msgid "Previously, this method only supported the format ``YYYY-MM-DD``."
msgstr "先前此方法只支援 ``YYYY-MM-DD`` 格式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:583
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`date` corresponding to the ISO calendar date specified by "
"*year*, *week* and *day*. This is the inverse of the function :meth:`date."
"isocalendar`."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於由 *year*、*week* 與 *day* 指定之 ISO 曆法日期的 :class:`date`。這"
"是 :meth:`date.isocalendar` 函式的反函式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:591
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.date` corresponding to *date_string*, parsed according to "
"*format*. This is equivalent to::"
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於 *date_string* 的 :class:`.date`，並依照 *format* 進行剖析。這等價"
"於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:594
msgid "date(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[0:3]))"
msgstr "date(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[0:3]))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:596
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is raised if the date_string and format can't be parsed "
"by :func:`time.strptime` or if it returns a value which isn't a time tuple.  "
"See also :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior` and :meth:`date.fromisoformat`."
msgstr ""
"如果 date_string 與 format 無法被 :func:`time.strptime` 剖析，或它回傳的值不"
"是時間元組，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-"
"behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`date.fromisoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:603 ../../library/datetime.rst:1178
msgid ""
"If *format* specifies a day of month (``%d``) without a year, :exc:"
"`ValueError` is raised.  This is to avoid a quadrennial leap year bug in "
"code seeking to parse only a month and day as the default year used in "
"absence of one in the format is not a leap year. The workaround is to always "
"include a year in your *format*.  If parsing *date_string* values that do "
"not have a year, explicitly add a year that is a leap year before parsing:"
msgstr ""
"如果 *format* 指定了該月第幾天 (``%d``) 但沒有指定年份，則會引發 :exc:"
"`ValueError`。這是為了避免只想剖析月份與日期的程式碼出現每四年發生一次的閏年"
"錯誤，因為格式中缺少年份時所使用的預設年份不是閏年。解決方法是一律在 "
"*format* 中包含年份。如果要剖析的 *date_string* 值沒有年份，請在剖析前明確加"
"上一個閏年："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:611
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> date_string = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> when = dt.date.strptime(f\"{date_string};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # Avoids "
"leap year bug.\n"
">>> when.strftime(\"%B %d\")\n"
"'February 29'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> date_string = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> when = dt.date.strptime(f\"{date_string};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # 避免閏"
"年錯誤。\n"
">>> when.strftime(\"%B %d\")\n"
"'February 29'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:626
msgid "The earliest representable date, ``date(MINYEAR, 1, 1)``."
msgstr "可表示的最早日期，``date(MINYEAR, 1, 1)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:631
msgid "The latest representable date, ``date(MAXYEAR, 12, 31)``."
msgstr "可表示的最晚日期，``date(MAXYEAR, 12, 31)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:636
msgid ""
"The smallest possible difference between non-equal date objects, "
"``timedelta(days=1)``."
msgstr "不相等的日期物件之間可能的最小差值，``timedelta(days=1)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:644 ../../library/datetime.rst:1219
msgid "Between :const:`MINYEAR` and :const:`MAXYEAR` inclusive."
msgstr "在 :const:`MINYEAR` 到 :const:`MAXYEAR` 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:649 ../../library/datetime.rst:1224
msgid "Between 1 and 12 inclusive."
msgstr "在 1 到 12 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:654 ../../library/datetime.rst:1229
msgid "Between 1 and the number of days in the given month of the given year."
msgstr "在 1 到該年該月的天數之間。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:662
msgid "``date2 = date1 + timedelta``"
msgstr "``date2 = date1 + timedelta``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:662
msgid "``date2`` will be ``timedelta.days`` days after ``date1``. (1)"
msgstr "``date2`` 會是 ``date1`` 之後再過 ``timedelta.days`` 天的日期。 (1)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:665
msgid "``date2 = date1 - timedelta``"
msgstr "``date2 = date1 - timedelta``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:665
msgid "Computes ``date2`` such that ``date2 + timedelta == date1``. (2)"
msgstr "計算出滿足 ``date2 + timedelta == date1`` 的 ``date2``。 (2)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:668
msgid "``timedelta = date1 - date2``"
msgstr "``timedelta = date1 - date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:668 ../../library/datetime.rst:1278
msgid "\\(3)"
msgstr "\\(3)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 == date2``"
msgstr "``date1 == date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 != date2``"
msgstr "``date1 != date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:670 ../../library/datetime.rst:1280
msgid "Equality comparison. (4)"
msgstr "相等性比較。 (4)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 < date2``"
msgstr "``date1 < date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 > date2``"
msgstr "``date1 > date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 <= date2``"
msgstr "``date1 <= date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:0
msgid "``date1 >= date2``"
msgstr "``date1 >= date2``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:673 ../../library/datetime.rst:1283
msgid "Order comparison. (5)"
msgstr "順序比較。 (5)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:682
msgid ""
"*date2* is moved forward in time if ``timedelta.days > 0``, or backward if "
"``timedelta.days < 0``. Afterward ``date2 - date1 == timedelta.days``. "
"``timedelta.seconds`` and ``timedelta.microseconds`` are ignored. :exc:"
"`OverflowError` is raised if ``date2.year`` would be smaller than :const:"
"`MINYEAR` or larger than :const:`MAXYEAR`."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``timedelta.days > 0``，*date2* 會往未來的方向移動；如果 ``timedelta."
"days < 0``，則往過去的方向移動。運算後 ``date2 - date1 == timedelta.days``。"
"``timedelta.seconds`` 與 ``timedelta.microseconds`` 會被忽略。如果 ``date2."
"year`` 會小於 :const:`MINYEAR` 或大於 :const:`MAXYEAR`，則會引發 :exc:"
"`OverflowError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:689
msgid "``timedelta.seconds`` and ``timedelta.microseconds`` are ignored."
msgstr "``timedelta.seconds`` 與 ``timedelta.microseconds`` 會被忽略。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:692
msgid ""
"This is exact, and cannot overflow. ``timedelta.seconds`` and ``timedelta."
"microseconds`` are 0, and ``date2 + timedelta == date1`` after."
msgstr ""
"這是精確的，且不會溢位。``timedelta.seconds`` 與 ``timedelta.microseconds`` "
"為 0，且運算後 ``date2 + timedelta == date1``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:696
msgid ":class:`date` objects are equal if they represent the same date."
msgstr "如果 :class:`date` 物件代表相同的日期，則它們相等。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:698
msgid ""
":class:`!date` objects that are not also :class:`.datetime` instances are "
"never equal to :class:`!datetime` objects, even if they represent the same "
"date."
msgstr ""
"不是 :class:`.datetime` 實例的 :class:`!date` 物件永遠不會等於 :class:`!"
"datetime` 物件，即使它們代表相同的日期。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:703
msgid ""
"*date1* is considered less than *date2* when *date1* precedes *date2* in "
"time. In other words, ``date1 < date2`` if and only if ``date1.toordinal() < "
"date2.toordinal()``."
msgstr ""
"當 *date1* 在時間上早於 *date2* 時，*date1* 被視為小於 *date2*。換句話說，"
"``date1 < date2`` 若且唯若 ``date1.toordinal() < date2.toordinal()``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:707
msgid ""
"Order comparison between a :class:`date` object that is not also a :class:`."
"datetime` instance and a :class:`!datetime` object raises :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
"不是 :class:`.datetime` 實例的 :class:`date` 物件與 :class:`!datetime` 物件之"
"間的順序比較會引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:711 ../../library/datetime.rst:1351
msgid ""
"Comparison between :class:`.datetime` object and an instance of the :class:"
"`date` subclass that is not a :class:`!datetime` subclass no longer converts "
"the latter to :class:`!date`, ignoring the time part and the time zone. The "
"default behavior can be changed by overriding the special comparison methods "
"in subclasses."
msgstr ""
":class:`.datetime` 物件與不是 :class:`!datetime` 子類別的 :class:`date` 子類"
"別實例之間的比較，不再將後者轉換為 :class:`!date` 而忽略時間部分與時區。可以"
"透過在子類別中覆寫特殊比較方法來改變預設行為。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:719
msgid ""
"In Boolean contexts, all :class:`date` objects are considered to be true."
msgstr "在布林情境中，所有 :class:`date` 物件都會被視為真。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:725
msgid ""
"Return a new :class:`date` object with the same values, but with specified "
"parameters updated."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個具有相同值的新 :class:`date` 物件，但以指定的參數更新對應的值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:728 ../../library/datetime.rst:2035
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:730
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.date(2002, 12, 31)\n"
">>> d.replace(day=26)\n"
"datetime.date(2002, 12, 26)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.date(2002, 12, 31)\n"
">>> d.replace(day=26)\n"
"datetime.date(2002, 12, 26)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:735
msgid ""
"The generic function :func:`copy.replace` also supports :class:`date` "
"objects."
msgstr "泛型函式 :func:`copy.replace` 也支援 :class:`date` 物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:741 ../../library/datetime.rst:1476
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`time.struct_time` such as returned by :func:`time."
"localtime`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`time.struct_time`，如同 :func:`time.localtime` 所回傳。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:743
msgid "The hours, minutes and seconds are 0, and the DST flag is -1."
msgstr "時、分、秒皆為 0，且 DST 旗標為 -1。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:745 ../../library/datetime.rst:1478
msgid "``d.timetuple()`` is equivalent to::"
msgstr "``d.timetuple()`` 等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:747
msgid ""
"time.struct_time((d.year, d.month, d.day, 0, 0, 0, d.weekday(), yday, -1))"
msgstr ""
"time.struct_time((d.year, d.month, d.day, 0, 0, 0, d.weekday(), yday, -1))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:749
msgid ""
"where ``yday = d.toordinal() - date(d.year, 1, 1).toordinal() + 1`` is the "
"day number within the current year starting with 1 for January 1st."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``yday = d.toordinal() - date(d.year, 1, 1).toordinal() + 1`` 是該日在該"
"年中的天數序號，1 月 1 日為 1。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:755
msgid ""
"Return the proleptic Gregorian ordinal of the date, where January 1 of year "
"1 has ordinal 1. For any :class:`date` object ``d``, ``date.fromordinal(d."
"toordinal()) == d``."
msgstr ""
"回傳該日期的逆推公曆序數，其中西元 1 年 1 月 1 日的序數為 1。對於任何 :class:"
"`date` 物件 ``d``，``date.fromordinal(d.toordinal()) == d``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:762
msgid ""
"Return the day of the week as an integer, where Monday is 0 and Sunday is 6. "
"For example, ``date(2002, 12, 4).weekday() == 2``, a Wednesday. See also :"
"meth:`isoweekday`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個代表星期幾的整數，星期一為 0、星期日為 6。例如 ``date(2002, 12, 4)."
"weekday() == 2`` 為星期三。也請參考 :meth:`isoweekday`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:769
msgid ""
"Return the day of the week as an integer, where Monday is 1 and Sunday is 7. "
"For example, ``date(2002, 12, 4).isoweekday() == 3``, a Wednesday. See also :"
"meth:`weekday`, :meth:`isocalendar`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個代表星期幾的整數，星期一為 1、星期日為 7。例如 ``date(2002, 12, 4)."
"isoweekday() == 3`` 為星期三。也請參考 :meth:`weekday`、:meth:`isocalendar`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:776
msgid ""
"Return a :term:`named tuple` object with three components: ``year``, "
"``week`` and ``weekday``."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個具有三個組成部分的\\ :term:`附名元組 <named tuple>`\\ 物件："
"``year``、``week`` 與 ``weekday``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:779
msgid ""
"The ISO calendar is a widely used variant of the Gregorian calendar. [#]_"
msgstr "ISO 曆法是公曆的一種廣泛使用的變體 [#]_。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:781
msgid ""
"The ISO year consists of 52 or 53 full weeks, and where a week starts on a "
"Monday and ends on a Sunday. The first week of an ISO year is the first "
"(Gregorian) calendar week of a year containing a Thursday. This is called "
"week number 1, and the ISO year of that Thursday is the same as its "
"Gregorian year."
msgstr ""
"ISO 年由 52 或 53 個完整的週組成，每週從星期一開始，到星期日結束。ISO 年的第"
"一週是該年中第一個包含星期四的（公曆）日曆週。這一週稱為第 1 週，而該星期四"
"的 ISO 年與其公曆年相同。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:786
msgid ""
"For example, 2004 begins on a Thursday, so the first week of ISO year 2004 "
"begins on Monday, 29 Dec 2003 and ends on Sunday, 4 Jan 2004::"
msgstr ""
"例如，2004 年從星期四開始，因此 ISO 2004 年的第一週從 2003 年 12 月 29 日星期"
"一開始，到 2004 年 1 月 4 日星期日結束： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:789
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2003, 12, 29).isocalendar()\n"
"datetime.IsoCalendarDate(year=2004, week=1, weekday=1)\n"
">>> dt.date(2004, 1, 4).isocalendar()\n"
"datetime.IsoCalendarDate(year=2004, week=1, weekday=7)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2003, 12, 29).isocalendar()\n"
"datetime.IsoCalendarDate(year=2004, week=1, weekday=1)\n"
">>> dt.date(2004, 1, 4).isocalendar()\n"
"datetime.IsoCalendarDate(year=2004, week=1, weekday=7)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:795
msgid "Result changed from a tuple to a :term:`named tuple`."
msgstr "結果從元組改為\\ :term:`附名元組 <named tuple>`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:801
msgid ""
"Return a string representing the date in ISO 8601 format, ``YYYY-MM-DD``::"
msgstr "回傳一個以 ISO 8601 格式 ``YYYY-MM-DD`` 表示日期的字串： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:803
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2002, 12, 4).isoformat()\n"
"'2002-12-04'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2002, 12, 4).isoformat()\n"
"'2002-12-04'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:810
msgid "For a date ``d``, ``str(d)`` is equivalent to ``d.isoformat()``."
msgstr "對於日期 ``d``，``str(d)`` 等價於 ``d.isoformat()``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:815
msgid "Return a string representing the date::"
msgstr "回傳一個表示該日期的字串： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:817
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2002, 12, 4).ctime()\n"
"'Wed Dec  4 00:00:00 2002'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.date(2002, 12, 4).ctime()\n"
"'Wed Dec  4 00:00:00 2002'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:821 ../../library/datetime.rst:1669
msgid "``d.ctime()`` is equivalent to::"
msgstr "``d.ctime()`` 等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:823 ../../library/datetime.rst:1671
msgid "time.ctime(time.mktime(d.timetuple()))"
msgstr "time.ctime(time.mktime(d.timetuple()))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:825
msgid ""
"on platforms where the native C :c:func:`ctime` function (which :func:`time."
"ctime` invokes, but which :meth:`date.ctime` does not invoke) conforms to "
"the C standard."
msgstr ""
"在原生 C :c:func:`ctime` 函式（:func:`time.ctime` 會叫用它，但 :meth:`date."
"ctime` 不會）符合 C 標準的平台上。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:832
msgid ""
"Return a string representing the date, controlled by an explicit format "
"string. Format codes referring to hours, minutes or seconds will see 0 "
"values. See also :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior` and :meth:`date."
"isoformat`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個表示該日期的字串，由明確的格式字串控制。指涉時、分、秒的格式碼會得到 "
"0 值。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`date."
"isoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:839
msgid ""
"Same as :meth:`.date.strftime`. This makes it possible to specify a format "
"string for a :class:`.date` object in :ref:`formatted string literals <f-"
"strings>` and when using :meth:`str.format`. See also :ref:`strftime-"
"strptime-behavior` and :meth:`date.isoformat`."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`.date.strftime` 相同。這使得在\\ :ref:`格式化字串字面值 <f-"
"strings>`\\ 中以及使用 :meth:`str.format` 時，可以為 :class:`.date` 物件指定"
"格式字串。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`date."
"isoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:846
msgid "Examples of usage: :class:`!date`"
msgstr "用法範例：:class:`!date`"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:848
msgid "Example of counting days to an event::"
msgstr "計算一個事件的天數的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:850
msgid ""
">>> import time\n"
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> today = dt.date.today()\n"
">>> today\n"
"datetime.date(2007, 12, 5)\n"
">>> today == dt.date.fromtimestamp(time.time())\n"
"True\n"
">>> my_birthday = dt.date(today.year, 6, 24)\n"
">>> if my_birthday < today:\n"
"...     my_birthday = my_birthday.replace(year=today.year + 1)\n"
"...\n"
">>> my_birthday\n"
"datetime.date(2008, 6, 24)\n"
">>> time_to_birthday = abs(my_birthday - today)\n"
">>> time_to_birthday.days\n"
"202"
msgstr ""
">>> import time\n"
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> today = dt.date.today()\n"
">>> today\n"
"datetime.date(2007, 12, 5)\n"
">>> today == dt.date.fromtimestamp(time.time())\n"
"True\n"
">>> my_birthday = dt.date(today.year, 6, 24)\n"
">>> if my_birthday < today:\n"
"...     my_birthday = my_birthday.replace(year=today.year + 1)\n"
"...\n"
">>> my_birthday\n"
"datetime.date(2008, 6, 24)\n"
">>> time_to_birthday = abs(my_birthday - today)\n"
">>> time_to_birthday.days\n"
"202"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:867
msgid "More examples of working with :class:`date`:"
msgstr "更多 :class:`date` 的用法範例："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:869
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.date.fromordinal(730920) # 730920th day after 1. 1. 0001\n"
">>> d\n"
"datetime.date(2002, 3, 11)\n"
"\n"
">>> # Methods related to formatting string output\n"
">>> d.isoformat()\n"
"'2002-03-11'\n"
">>> d.strftime(\"%d/%m/%y\")\n"
"'11/03/02'\n"
">>> d.strftime(\"%A %d. %B %Y\")\n"
"'Monday 11. March 2002'\n"
">>> d.ctime()\n"
"'Mon Mar 11 00:00:00 2002'\n"
">>> 'The {1} is {0:%d}, the {2} is {0:%B}.'.format(d, \"day\", \"month\")\n"
"'The day is 11, the month is March.'\n"
"\n"
">>> # Methods for extracting 'components' under different calendars\n"
">>> t = d.timetuple()\n"
">>> for i in t:\n"
"...     print(i)\n"
"2002                # year\n"
"3                   # month\n"
"11                  # day\n"
"0\n"
"0\n"
"0\n"
"0                   # weekday (0 = Monday)\n"
"70                  # 70th day in the year\n"
"-1\n"
">>> ic = d.isocalendar()\n"
">>> for i in ic:\n"
"...     print(i)\n"
"2002                # ISO year\n"
"11                  # ISO week number\n"
"1                   # ISO day number ( 1 = Monday )\n"
"\n"
">>> # A date object is immutable; all operations produce a new object\n"
">>> d.replace(year=2005)\n"
"datetime.date(2005, 3, 11)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> d = dt.date.fromordinal(730920) # 0001 年 1 月 1 日之後的第 730920 天\n"
">>> d\n"
"datetime.date(2002, 3, 11)\n"
"\n"
">>> # 與格式化字串輸出相關的方法\n"
">>> d.isoformat()\n"
"'2002-03-11'\n"
">>> d.strftime(\"%d/%m/%y\")\n"
"'11/03/02'\n"
">>> d.strftime(\"%A %d. %B %Y\")\n"
"'Monday 11. March 2002'\n"
">>> d.ctime()\n"
"'Mon Mar 11 00:00:00 2002'\n"
">>> 'The {1} is {0:%d}, the {2} is {0:%B}.'.format(d, \"day\", \"month\")\n"
"'The day is 11, the month is March.'\n"
"\n"
">>> # 在不同曆法下擷取「組成部分」的方法\n"
">>> t = d.timetuple()\n"
">>> for i in t:\n"
"...     print(i)\n"
"2002                # 年\n"
"3                   # 月\n"
"11                  # 日\n"
"0\n"
"0\n"
"0\n"
"0                   # 星期幾（0 = 星期一）\n"
"70                  # 一年中的第 70 天\n"
"-1\n"
">>> ic = d.isocalendar()\n"
">>> for i in ic:\n"
"...     print(i)\n"
"2002                # ISO 年\n"
"11                  # ISO 週數\n"
"1                   # ISO 星期幾（1 = 星期一）\n"
"\n"
">>> # date 物件是不可變的；所有運算都會產生新的物件\n"
">>> d.replace(year=2005)\n"
"datetime.date(2005, 3, 11)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:916
msgid ":class:`!datetime` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!datetime` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:918
msgid ""
"A :class:`.datetime` object is a single object containing all the "
"information from a :class:`date` object and a :class:`.time` object."
msgstr ""
":class:`.datetime` 物件是一個包含 :class:`date` 物件與 :class:`.time` 物件所"
"有資訊的單一物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:921
msgid ""
"Like a :class:`date` object, :class:`.datetime` assumes the current "
"Gregorian calendar extended in both directions; like a :class:`.time` "
"object, :class:`!datetime` assumes there are exactly 3600\\*24 seconds in "
"every day."
msgstr ""
"與 :class:`date` 物件一樣，:class:`.datetime` 假設目前的公曆往前後兩個方向延"
"伸；與 :class:`.time` 物件一樣，:class:`!datetime` 假設每天剛好有 3600\\*24 "
"秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:925
msgid "Constructor:"
msgstr "建構函式："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:929
msgid ""
"The *year*, *month* and *day* arguments are required. *tzinfo* may be "
"``None``, or an instance of a :class:`tzinfo` subclass. The remaining "
"arguments must be integers in the following ranges:"
msgstr ""
"*year*、*month* 與 *day* 引數是必要的。*tzinfo* 可以是 ``None`` 或 :class:"
"`tzinfo` 子類別的實例。其餘引數必須是在以下範圍內的整數："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:933
msgid "``MINYEAR <= year <= MAXYEAR``,"
msgstr "``MINYEAR <= year <= MAXYEAR``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:934
msgid "``1 <= month <= 12``,"
msgstr "``1 <= month <= 12``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:935
msgid "``1 <= day <= number of days in the given month and year``,"
msgstr "``1 <= day <= number of days in the given month and year``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:936 ../../library/datetime.rst:1834
msgid "``0 <= hour < 24``,"
msgstr "``0 <= hour < 24``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:937 ../../library/datetime.rst:1835
msgid "``0 <= minute < 60``,"
msgstr "``0 <= minute < 60``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:938 ../../library/datetime.rst:1836
msgid "``0 <= second < 60``,"
msgstr "``0 <= second < 60``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:939 ../../library/datetime.rst:1837
msgid "``0 <= microsecond < 1000000``,"
msgstr "``0 <= microsecond < 1000000``,"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:940 ../../library/datetime.rst:1838
msgid "``fold in [0, 1]``."
msgstr "``fold in [0, 1]``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:944 ../../library/datetime.rst:1397
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2002
msgid "Added the *fold* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *fold* 參數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:952
msgid "Return the current local date and time, with :attr:`.tzinfo` ``None``."
msgstr "回傳目前的本地日期與時間，且 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:954
msgid "Equivalent to::"
msgstr "等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:956
msgid "datetime.fromtimestamp(time.time())"
msgstr "datetime.fromtimestamp(time.time())"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:958
msgid "See also :meth:`now`, :meth:`fromtimestamp`."
msgstr "也請參考 :meth:`now`、:meth:`fromtimestamp`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:960
msgid ""
"This method is functionally equivalent to :meth:`now`, but without a ``tz`` "
"parameter."
msgstr "此方法在功能上等價於 :meth:`now`，但沒有 ``tz`` 參數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:966
msgid "Return the current local date and time."
msgstr "回傳目前的本地日期與時間。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:968
msgid ""
"If optional argument *tz* is ``None`` or not specified, this is like :meth:"
"`today`, but, if possible, supplies more precision than can be gotten from "
"going through a :func:`time.time` timestamp (for example, this may be "
"possible on platforms supplying the C :c:func:`gettimeofday` function)."
msgstr ""
"如果選用的引數 *tz* 為 ``None`` 或未指定，則會像是 :meth:`today`，但盡可能提"
"供比透過 :func:`time.time` 取得的時間戳記更多位數的資訊（例如，這在有提供 C :"
"c:func:`gettimeofday` 函式的平台上可能可行）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:974
msgid ""
"If *tz* is not ``None``, it must be an instance of a :class:`tzinfo` "
"subclass, and the current date and time are converted to *tz*’s time zone."
msgstr ""
"如果 *tz* 不是 ``None``，它必須是 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別的實例，且目前的日期"
"與時間會被轉換為 *tz* 的時區。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:977
msgid "This function is preferred over :meth:`today` and :meth:`utcnow`."
msgstr "建議優先使用此函式，而非 :meth:`today` 與 :meth:`utcnow`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:981
msgid ""
"Subsequent calls to :meth:`!datetime.now` may return the same instant "
"depending on the precision of the underlying clock."
msgstr ""
"依據底層時鐘的精度，連續呼叫 :meth:`!datetime.now` 可能會回傳相同的時間點。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:987
msgid "Return the current UTC date and time, with :attr:`.tzinfo` ``None``."
msgstr "回傳目前的 UTC 日期與時間，且 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:989
msgid ""
"This is like :meth:`now`, but returns the current UTC date and time, as a "
"naive :class:`.datetime` object. An aware current UTC datetime can be "
"obtained by calling ``datetime.now(timezone.utc)``. See also :meth:`now`."
msgstr ""
"這類似於 :meth:`now`，但會以 naive 的 :class:`.datetime` 物件回傳目前的 UTC "
"日期與時間。可以透過呼叫 ``datetime.now(timezone.utc)`` 取得 aware 的目前 "
"UTC datetime。也請參考 :meth:`now`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:995
msgid ""
"Because naive ``datetime`` objects are treated by many ``datetime`` methods "
"as local times, it is preferred to use aware datetimes to represent times in "
"UTC. As such, the recommended way to create an object representing the "
"current time in UTC is by calling ``datetime.now(timezone.utc)``."
msgstr ""
"由於許多 ``datetime`` 方法會將 naive 的 ``datetime`` 物件視為本地時間，因此建"
"議使用 aware 的 datetime 來表示 UTC 時間。所以，建立代表目前 UTC 時間之物件的"
"建議方式是呼叫 ``datetime.now(timezone.utc)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1002
msgid "Use :meth:`datetime.now` with :const:`UTC` instead."
msgstr "請改用 :meth:`datetime.now` 並搭配 :const:`UTC`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1007
msgid ""
"Return the local date and time corresponding to the POSIX timestamp, such as "
"is returned by :func:`time.time`. If optional argument *tz* is ``None`` or "
"not specified, the timestamp is converted to the platform's local date and "
"time, and the returned :class:`.datetime` object is naive."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於 POSIX 時間戳記的本地日期與時間，例如 :func:`time.time` 所回傳的"
"值。如果選用引數 *tz* 為 ``None`` 或未指定，時間戳記會被轉換為平台的本地日期"
"與時間，且回傳的 :class:`.datetime` 物件是 naive 的。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1012
msgid ""
"If *tz* is not ``None``, it must be an instance of a :class:`tzinfo` "
"subclass, and the timestamp is converted to *tz*’s time zone."
msgstr ""
"如果 *tz* 不是 ``None``，它必須是 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別的實例，且時間戳記會"
"被轉換為 *tz* 的時區。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1015
msgid ""
":meth:`fromtimestamp` may raise :exc:`OverflowError`, if the timestamp is "
"out of the range of values supported by the platform C :c:func:`localtime` "
"or :c:func:`gmtime` functions, and :exc:`OSError` on :c:func:`localtime` or :"
"c:func:`gmtime` failure. It's common for this to be restricted to years in "
"1970 through 2038. Note that on non-POSIX systems that include leap seconds "
"in their notion of a timestamp, leap seconds are ignored by :meth:"
"`fromtimestamp`, and then it's possible to have two timestamps differing by "
"a second that yield identical :class:`.datetime` objects. This method is "
"preferred over :meth:`utcfromtimestamp`."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`localtime` 或 :c:func:`gmtime` 函式所支援的值"
"範圍，:meth:`fromtimestamp` 可能會引發 :exc:`OverflowError`；如果 :c:func:"
"`localtime` 或 :c:func:`gmtime` 執行失敗，則會引發 :exc:`OSError`。通常範圍會"
"被限制在 1970 年到 2038 年之間。請注意，在時間戳記概念中包含閏秒的非 POSIX 系"
"統上，:meth:`fromtimestamp` 會忽略閏秒，因此可能會有兩個相差一秒的時間戳記產"
"生相同的 :class:`.datetime` 物件。建議優先使用此方法，而非 :meth:"
"`utcfromtimestamp`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1026
msgid ""
"Raise :exc:`OverflowError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` if the timestamp is "
"out of the range of values supported by the platform C :c:func:`localtime` "
"or :c:func:`gmtime` functions. Raise :exc:`OSError` instead of :exc:"
"`ValueError` on :c:func:`localtime` or :c:func:`gmtime` failure."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`localtime` 或 :c:func:`gmtime` 函式所支援的值"
"範圍，會引發 :exc:`OverflowError` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。:c:func:"
"`localtime` 或 :c:func:`gmtime` 執行失敗時會引發 :exc:`OSError` 而不是 :exc:"
"`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1033
msgid ":meth:`fromtimestamp` may return instances with :attr:`.fold` set to 1."
msgstr ":meth:`fromtimestamp` 可能會回傳 :attr:`.fold` 被設為 1 的實例。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1042
msgid ""
"Return the UTC :class:`.datetime` corresponding to the POSIX timestamp, "
"with :attr:`.tzinfo` ``None``.  (The resulting object is naive.)"
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於 POSIX 時間戳記的 UTC :class:`.datetime`，且 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 "
"``None``。（產生的物件是 naive 的。）"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1045
msgid ""
"This may raise :exc:`OverflowError`, if the timestamp is out of the range of "
"values supported by the platform C :c:func:`gmtime` function, and :exc:"
"`OSError` on :c:func:`gmtime` failure. It's common for this to be restricted "
"to years in 1970 through 2038."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`gmtime` 函式所支援的值範圍，可能會引發 :exc:"
"`OverflowError`；如果 :c:func:`gmtime` 執行失敗，則會引發 :exc:`OSError`。通"
"常範圍會被限制在 1970 年到 2038 年之間。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1050
msgid "To get an aware :class:`.datetime` object, call :meth:`fromtimestamp`::"
msgstr ""
"若要取得 aware 的 :class:`.datetime` 物件，請呼叫 :meth:`fromtimestamp`： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1052
msgid "datetime.fromtimestamp(timestamp, timezone.utc)"
msgstr "datetime.fromtimestamp(timestamp, timezone.utc)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1054
msgid ""
"On the POSIX compliant platforms, it is equivalent to the following "
"expression::"
msgstr "在符合 POSIX 的平台上，它等價於以下運算式： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1057
msgid ""
"datetime(1970, 1, 1, tzinfo=timezone.utc) + timedelta(seconds=timestamp)"
msgstr ""
"datetime(1970, 1, 1, tzinfo=timezone.utc) + timedelta(seconds=timestamp)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1059
msgid ""
"except the latter formula always supports the full years range: between :"
"const:`MINYEAR` and :const:`MAXYEAR` inclusive."
msgstr ""
"差別在於後者的公式永遠支援完整的年份範圍：介於 :const:`MINYEAR` 與 :const:"
"`MAXYEAR` 之間（含）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1064
msgid ""
"Because naive ``datetime`` objects are treated by many ``datetime`` methods "
"as local times, it is preferred to use aware datetimes to represent times in "
"UTC. As such, the recommended way to create an object representing a "
"specific timestamp in UTC is by calling ``datetime.fromtimestamp(timestamp, "
"tz=timezone.utc)``."
msgstr ""
"由於許多 ``datetime`` 方法會將 naive 的 ``datetime`` 物件視為本地時間，因此建"
"議使用 aware 的 datetime 來表示 UTC 時間。所以，建立代表特定 UTC 時間戳記之物"
"件的建議方式是呼叫 ``datetime.fromtimestamp(timestamp, tz=timezone.utc)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1070
msgid ""
"Raise :exc:`OverflowError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` if the timestamp is "
"out of the range of values supported by the platform C :c:func:`gmtime` "
"function. Raise :exc:`OSError` instead of :exc:`ValueError` on :c:func:"
"`gmtime` failure."
msgstr ""
"如果時間戳記超出平台 C :c:func:`gmtime` 函式所支援的值範圍，會引發 :exc:"
"`OverflowError` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。:c:func:`gmtime` 執行失敗時會引發 :"
"exc:`OSError` 而不是 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1081
msgid "Use :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` with :const:`UTC` instead."
msgstr "請改用 :meth:`datetime.fromtimestamp` 並搭配 :const:`UTC`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1086
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`.datetime` corresponding to the proleptic Gregorian "
"ordinal, where January 1 of year 1 has ordinal 1. :exc:`ValueError` is "
"raised unless ``1 <= ordinal <= datetime.max.toordinal()``. The hour, "
"minute, second and microsecond of the result are all 0, and :attr:`.tzinfo` "
"is ``None``."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於逆推公曆序數的 :class:`.datetime`，其中西元 1 年 1 月 1 日的序數為 "
"1。除非 ``1 <= ordinal <= datetime.max.toordinal()``，否則會引發 :exc:"
"`ValueError`。結果的時、分、秒與微秒皆為 0，且 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1094
msgid ""
"Return a new :class:`.datetime` object whose date components are equal to "
"the given :class:`date` object's, and whose time components are equal to the "
"given :class:`.time` object's. If the *tzinfo* argument is provided, its "
"value is used to set the :attr:`.tzinfo` attribute of the result, otherwise "
"the :attr:`~.time.tzinfo` attribute of the *time* argument is used.  If the "
"*date* argument is a :class:`!datetime` object, its time components and :"
"attr:`.tzinfo` attributes are ignored."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個新的 :class:`.datetime` 物件，其日期部分與給定的 :class:`date` 物件相"
"同，時間部分與給定的 :class:`.time` 物件相同。如果有提供 *tzinfo* 引數，則會"
"使用其值來設定結果的 :attr:`.tzinfo` 屬性，否則會使用 *time* 引數的 :attr:`~."
"time.tzinfo` 屬性。如果 *date* 引數是 :class:`!datetime` 物件，則其時間部分"
"與 :attr:`.tzinfo` 屬性會被忽略。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1102
msgid ""
"For any :class:`.datetime` object ``d``, ``d == datetime.combine(d.date(), d."
"time(), d.tzinfo)``."
msgstr ""
"對於任何 :class:`.datetime` 物件 ``d``，``d == datetime.combine(d.date(), d."
"time(), d.tzinfo)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1105
msgid "Added the *tzinfo* argument."
msgstr "新增 *tzinfo* 引數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1111
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.datetime` corresponding to a *date_string* in any valid "
"ISO 8601 format, with the following exceptions:"
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於以任何有效 ISO 8601 格式給定之 *date_string* 的 :class:`."
"datetime`，但有以下例外："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1114 ../../library/datetime.rst:1936
msgid "Time zone offsets may have fractional seconds."
msgstr "時區偏移量可以包含小數秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1115
msgid "The ``T`` separator may be replaced by any single unicode character."
msgstr "``T`` 分隔符號可以替換為任何單一 unicode 字元。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1116 ../../library/datetime.rst:1941
msgid "Fractional hours and minutes are not supported."
msgstr "不支援小數形式的時與分。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1125
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 0)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('20111104')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 0)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23Z')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('20111104T000523')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-W01-2T00:05:23.283')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 1, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04 00:05:23.283')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04 00:05:23.283+00:00')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000, tzinfo=datetime.timezone."
"utc)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23+04:00')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23,\n"
"    tzinfo=datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(seconds=14400)))"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 0)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('20111104')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 0)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23Z')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('20111104T000523')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-W01-2T00:05:23.283')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 1, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04 00:05:23.283')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04 00:05:23.283+00:00')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23, 283000, tzinfo=datetime.timezone."
"utc)\n"
">>> dt.datetime.fromisoformat('2011-11-04T00:05:23+04:00')\n"
"datetime.datetime(2011, 11, 4, 0, 5, 23,\n"
"    tzinfo=datetime.timezone(datetime.timedelta(seconds=14400)))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1147
msgid ""
"Previously, this method only supported formats that could be emitted by :"
"meth:`date.isoformat` or :meth:`datetime.isoformat`."
msgstr ""
"先前此方法只支援 :meth:`date.isoformat` 或 :meth:`datetime.isoformat` 所能產"
"生的格式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1154
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.datetime` corresponding to the ISO calendar date specified "
"by *year*, *week* and *day*. The non-date components of the datetime are "
"populated with their normal default values. This is the inverse of the "
"function :meth:`datetime.isocalendar`."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於由 *year*、*week* 與 *day* 指定之 ISO 曆法日期的 :class:`."
"datetime`。datetime 中非日期的部分會以其一般的預設值填入。這是 :meth:"
"`datetime.isocalendar` 函式的反函式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1164
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.datetime` corresponding to *date_string*, parsed according "
"to *format*."
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於 *date_string* 的 :class:`.datetime`，並依照 *format* 進行剖析。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1167
msgid ""
"If *format* does not contain microseconds or time zone information, this is "
"equivalent to::"
msgstr "如果 *format* 不包含微秒或時區資訊，這等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1169 ../../library/datetime.rst:2777
msgid "datetime(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[0:6]))"
msgstr "datetime(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[0:6]))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1171
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is raised if the date_string and format can't be parsed "
"by :func:`time.strptime` or if it returns a value which isn't a time tuple.  "
"See also :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior` and :meth:`datetime."
"fromisoformat`."
msgstr ""
"如果 date_string 與 format 無法被 :func:`time.strptime` 剖析，或它回傳的值不"
"是時間元組，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-"
"behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`datetime.fromisoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1186
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> date_string = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> when = dt.datetime.strptime(f\"{date_string};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # "
"Avoids leap year bug.\n"
">>> when.strftime(\"%B %d\")\n"
"'February 29'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> date_string = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> when = dt.datetime.strptime(f\"{date_string};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # 避"
"免閏年錯誤。\n"
">>> when.strftime(\"%B %d\")\n"
"'February 29'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1199
msgid ""
"The earliest representable :class:`.datetime`, ``datetime(MINYEAR, 1, 1, "
"tzinfo=None)``."
msgstr ""
"可表示的最早 :class:`.datetime`，``datetime(MINYEAR, 1, 1, tzinfo=None)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1205
msgid ""
"The latest representable :class:`.datetime`, ``datetime(MAXYEAR, 12, 31, 23, "
"59, 59, 999999, tzinfo=None)``."
msgstr ""
"可表示的最晚 :class:`.datetime`，``datetime(MAXYEAR, 12, 31, 23, 59, 59, "
"999999, tzinfo=None)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1211
msgid ""
"The smallest possible difference between non-equal :class:`.datetime` "
"objects, ``timedelta(microseconds=1)``."
msgstr ""
"不相等的 :class:`.datetime` 物件之間可能的最小差值，"
"``timedelta(microseconds=1)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1234 ../../library/datetime.rst:1868
msgid "In ``range(24)``."
msgstr "在 ``range(24)`` 範圍內。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1239 ../../library/datetime.rst:1244
#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1873 ../../library/datetime.rst:1878
msgid "In ``range(60)``."
msgstr "在 ``range(60)`` 範圍內。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1249 ../../library/datetime.rst:1883
msgid "In ``range(1000000)``."
msgstr "在 ``range(1000000)`` 範圍內。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1254
msgid ""
"The object passed as the *tzinfo* argument to the :class:`.datetime` "
"constructor, or ``None`` if none was passed."
msgstr ""
"作為 *tzinfo* 引數傳給 :class:`.datetime` 建構函式的物件；如果沒有傳入則為 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1260 ../../library/datetime.rst:1894
msgid ""
"In ``[0, 1]``. Used to disambiguate wall times during a repeated interval. "
"(A repeated interval occurs when clocks are rolled back at the end of "
"daylight saving time or when the UTC offset for the current zone is "
"decreased for political reasons.) The values 0 and 1 represent, "
"respectively, the earlier and later of the two moments with the same wall "
"time representation."
msgstr ""
"在 ``[0, 1]`` 範圍內。用於在重複區間內消除牆上時間 (wall time) 的歧義。（當日"
"光節約時間結束時將時鐘撥回，或目前時區的 UTC 偏移因政治因素而減少時，就會出現"
"重複區間。）值 0 和 1 分別代表具有相同牆上時間表示的兩個時刻中較早與較晚的那"
"一個。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1274
msgid "``datetime2 = datetime1 + timedelta``"
msgstr "``datetime2 = datetime1 + timedelta``"

