#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1749
msgid ""
"The example below defines a :class:`tzinfo` subclass capturing time zone "
"information for Kabul, Afghanistan, which used +4 UTC until 1945 and then "
"+4:30 UTC thereafter::"
msgstr ""
"以下範例定義了一個 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別，用來記錄阿富汗喀布爾的時區資訊；喀"
"布爾在 1945 年以前使用 UTC +4，之後則使用 UTC +4:30： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1753
msgid ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"class KabulTz(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"    # Kabul used +4 until 1945, when they moved to +4:30\n"
"    UTC_MOVE_DATE = dt.datetime(1944, 12, 31, 20, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        if when.year < 1945:\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4)\n"
"        elif (1945, 1, 1, 0, 0) <= when.timetuple()[:5] < (1945, 1, 1, 0, "
"30):\n"
"            # An ambiguous (\"imaginary\") half-hour range representing\n"
"            # a 'fold' in time due to the shift from +4 to +4:30.\n"
"            # If when falls in the imaginary range, use fold to decide how\n"
"            # to resolve. See PEP 495.\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=(30 if when.fold else 0))\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=30)\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        # Follow same validations as in datetime.tzinfo\n"
"        if not isinstance(when, dt.datetime):\n"
"            raise TypeError(\"fromutc() requires a datetime argument\")\n"
"        if when.tzinfo is not self:\n"
"            raise ValueError(\"when.tzinfo is not self\")\n"
"\n"
"        # A custom implementation is required for fromutc as\n"
"        # the input to this function is a datetime with utc values\n"
"        # but with a tzinfo set to self.\n"
"        # See datetime.astimezone or fromtimestamp.\n"
"        if when.replace(tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc) >= self.UTC_MOVE_DATE:\n"
"            return when + dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=30)\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return when + dt.timedelta(hours=4)\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        # Kabul does not observe daylight saving time.\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        if when >= self.UTC_MOVE_DATE:\n"
"            return \"+04:30\"\n"
"        return \"+04\""
msgstr ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"class KabulTz(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"    # 喀布爾在 1945 年以前使用 +4，之後改為 +4:30\n"
"    UTC_MOVE_DATE = dt.datetime(1944, 12, 31, 20, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        if when.year < 1945:\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4)\n"
"        elif (1945, 1, 1, 0, 0) <= when.timetuple()[:5] < (1945, 1, 1, 0, "
"30):\n"
"            # 一個有歧義的（「虛構的」）半小時區間，代表從 +4 轉換到\n"
"            # +4:30 所造成的時間「fold」。\n"
"            # 如果 when 落在這個虛構的區間內，則使用 fold 來決定\n"
"            # 如何消除歧義。請參閱 PEP 495。\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=(30 if when.fold else 0))\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=30)\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        # 遵循與 datetime.tzinfo 相同的驗證\n"
"        if not isinstance(when, dt.datetime):\n"
"            raise TypeError(\"fromutc() requires a datetime argument\")\n"
"        if when.tzinfo is not self:\n"
"            raise ValueError(\"when.tzinfo is not self\")\n"
"\n"
"        # fromutc 需要自訂實作，因為此函式的輸入\n"
"        # 是一個具有 utc 值、但 tzinfo 被設為 self 的\n"
"        # datetime。\n"
"        # 請參閱 datetime.astimezone 或 fromtimestamp。\n"
"        if when.replace(tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc) >= self.UTC_MOVE_DATE:\n"
"            return when + dt.timedelta(hours=4, minutes=30)\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return when + dt.timedelta(hours=4)\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        # 喀布爾不實施日光節約時間。\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        if when >= self.UTC_MOVE_DATE:\n"
"            return \"+04:30\"\n"
"        return \"+04\""

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1796
msgid "Usage of ``KabulTz`` from above::"
msgstr "上述 ``KabulTz`` 的用法： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1798
msgid ""
">>> tz1 = KabulTz()\n"
"\n"
">>> # Datetime before the change\n"
">>> dt1 = dt.datetime(1900, 11, 21, 16, 30, tzinfo=tz1)\n"
">>> print(dt1.utcoffset())\n"
"4:00:00\n"
"\n"
">>> # Datetime after the change\n"
">>> dt2 = dt.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 13, 0, tzinfo=tz1)\n"
">>> print(dt2.utcoffset())\n"
"4:30:00\n"
"\n"
">>> # Convert datetime to another time zone\n"
">>> dt3 = dt2.astimezone(dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt3\n"
"datetime.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 8, 30, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt2\n"
"datetime.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 13, 0, tzinfo=KabulTz())\n"
">>> dt2 == dt3\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> tz1 = KabulTz()\n"
"\n"
">>> # 變更前的 datetime\n"
">>> dt1 = dt.datetime(1900, 11, 21, 16, 30, tzinfo=tz1)\n"
">>> print(dt1.utcoffset())\n"
"4:00:00\n"
"\n"
">>> # 變更後的 datetime\n"
">>> dt2 = dt.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 13, 0, tzinfo=tz1)\n"
">>> print(dt2.utcoffset())\n"
"4:30:00\n"
"\n"
">>> # 將 datetime 轉換到另一個時區\n"
">>> dt3 = dt2.astimezone(dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt3\n"
"datetime.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 8, 30, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt2\n"
"datetime.datetime(2006, 6, 14, 13, 0, tzinfo=KabulTz())\n"
">>> dt2 == dt3\n"
"True"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1823
msgid ":class:`!time` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!time` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1825
msgid ""
"A :class:`.time` object represents a (local) time of day, independent of any "
"particular day, and subject to adjustment via a :class:`tzinfo` object."
msgstr ""
":class:`.time` 物件代表一天中的（本地）時間，與任何特定日期無關，並可透過 :"
"class:`tzinfo` 物件進行調整。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1830
msgid ""
"All arguments are optional. *tzinfo* may be ``None``, or an instance of a :"
"class:`tzinfo` subclass. The remaining arguments must be integers in the "
"following ranges:"
msgstr ""
"所有引數都是選用的。*tzinfo* 可以是 ``None`` 或 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別的實"
"例。其餘引數必須是在以下範圍內的整數："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1840
msgid ""
"If an argument outside those ranges is given, :exc:`ValueError` is raised. "
"All default to 0 except *tzinfo*, which defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"如果給定的引數超出這些範圍，會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。除了 *tzinfo* 預設為 "
"``None`` 之外，其餘引數預設皆為 0。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1849
msgid "The earliest representable :class:`.time`, ``time(0, 0, 0, 0)``."
msgstr "可表示的最早 :class:`.time`，``time(0, 0, 0, 0)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1854
msgid "The latest representable :class:`.time`, ``time(23, 59, 59, 999999)``."
msgstr "可表示的最晚 :class:`.time`，``time(23, 59, 59, 999999)``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1859
msgid ""
"The smallest possible difference between non-equal :class:`.time` objects, "
"``timedelta(microseconds=1)``, although note that arithmetic on :class:`."
"time` objects is not supported."
msgstr ""
"不相等的 :class:`.time` 物件之間可能的最小差值，"
"``timedelta(microseconds=1)``，但請注意 :class:`.time` 物件並不支援算術運算。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1888
msgid ""
"The object passed as the tzinfo argument to the :class:`.time` constructor, "
"or ``None`` if none was passed."
msgstr ""
"作為 tzinfo 引數傳給 :class:`.time` 建構函式的物件；如果沒有傳入則為 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1903
msgid ""
":class:`.time` objects support equality and order comparisons, where ``a`` "
"is considered less than ``b`` when ``a`` precedes ``b`` in time."
msgstr ""
":class:`.time` 物件支援相等性比較與順序比較，當 ``a`` 在時間上早於 ``b`` 時，"
"``a`` 被視為小於 ``b``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1906
msgid ""
"Naive and aware :class:`!time` objects are never equal. Order comparison "
"between naive and aware :class:`!time` objects raises :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
"naive 與 aware 的 :class:`!time` 物件永遠不會相等。naive 與 aware 的 :class:"
"`!time` 物件之間的順序比較會引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1910
msgid ""
"If both comparands are aware, and have the same :attr:`~.time.tzinfo` "
"attribute, the :attr:`!tzinfo` and :attr:`!fold` attributes are ignored and "
"the base times are compared. If both comparands are aware and have "
"different :attr:`!tzinfo` attributes, the comparands are first adjusted by "
"subtracting their UTC offsets (obtained from ``self.utcoffset()``)."
msgstr ""
"如果比較的兩方都是 aware 且具有相同的 :attr:`~.time.tzinfo` 屬性，則會忽略 :"
"attr:`!tzinfo` 與 :attr:`!fold` 屬性，並比較基礎的時間。如果比較的兩方都是 "
"aware 但具有不同的 :attr:`!tzinfo` 屬性，則會先將兩方各自減去其 UTC 偏移（由 "
"``self.utcoffset()`` 取得）來進行調整。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1916
msgid ""
"Equality comparisons between aware and naive :class:`.time` instances don't "
"raise :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
"aware 與 naive 的 :class:`.time` 實例之間的相等性比較不會引發 :exc:"
"`TypeError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1920
msgid ""
"In Boolean contexts, a :class:`.time` object is always considered to be true."
msgstr "在布林情境中，:class:`.time` 物件一律被視為真。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1922
msgid ""
"Before Python 3.5, a :class:`.time` object was considered to be false if it "
"represented midnight in UTC. This behavior was considered obscure and error-"
"prone and has been removed in Python 3.5. See :issue:`13936` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 3.5 之前，如果 :class:`.time` 物件代表 UTC 的午夜，則會被視為假。這"
"個行為被認為晦澀且容易出錯，因此已在 Python 3.5 中移除。詳細資訊請參閱 :"
"issue:`13936`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1929
msgid "Other constructors:"
msgstr "其他建構函式："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1933
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.time` corresponding to a *time_string* in any valid ISO "
"8601 format, with the following exceptions:"
msgstr ""
"回傳對應於以任何有效 ISO 8601 格式給定之 *time_string* 的 :class:`.time`，但"
"有以下例外："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1937
msgid ""
"The leading ``T``, normally required in cases where there may be ambiguity "
"between a date and a time, is not required."
msgstr ""
"開頭的 ``T`` 不是必要的；通常只有在日期與時間之間可能有歧義的情況下才需要它。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1939
msgid ""
"Fractional seconds may have any number of digits (anything beyond 6 will be "
"truncated)."
msgstr "小數秒可以有任意位數（超過 6 位的部分會被截斷）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1943
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "範例："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1945
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('T04:23:01')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('T042301')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01.000384')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, 384)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01,000384')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, 384)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01+04:00')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone(datetime."
"timedelta(seconds=14400)))\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01Z')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01+00:00')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('T04:23:01')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('T042301')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01.000384')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, 384)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01,000384')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, 384)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01+04:00')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone(datetime."
"timedelta(seconds=14400)))\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01Z')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> dt.time.fromisoformat('04:23:01+00:00')\n"
"datetime.time(4, 23, 1, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1967
msgid ""
"Previously, this method only supported formats that could be emitted by :"
"meth:`time.isoformat`."
msgstr "先前此方法只支援 :meth:`time.isoformat` 所能產生的格式。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1974
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`.time` corresponding to *date_string*, parsed according to "
"*format*."
msgstr "回傳對應於 *date_string* 的 :class:`.time`，並依照 *format* 進行剖析。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1977
msgid ""
"If *format* does not contain microseconds or timezone information, this is "
"equivalent to::"
msgstr "如果 *format* 不包含微秒或時區資訊，這等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1979
msgid "time(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[3:6]))"
msgstr "time(*(time.strptime(date_string, format)[3:6]))"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1981
msgid ""
":exc:`ValueError` is raised if the *date_string* and *format* cannot be "
"parsed by :func:`time.strptime` or if it returns a value which is not a time "
"tuple.  See also :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior` and :meth:`time."
"fromisoformat`."
msgstr ""
"如果 *date_string* 與 *format* 無法被 :func:`time.strptime` 剖析，或它回傳的"
"值不是時間元組，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-"
"behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`time.fromisoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1994
msgid ""
"Return a new :class:`.time` with the same values, but with specified "
"parameters updated. Note that ``tzinfo=None`` can be specified to create a "
"naive :class:`!time` from an aware :class:`!time`, without conversion of the "
"time data."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個具有相同值的新 :class:`.time`，但以指定的參數更新對應的值。請注意，可"
"以指定 ``tzinfo=None`` 來從 aware 的 :class:`!time` 建立 naive 的 :class:`!"
"time`，而不轉換時間資料。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:1999
msgid ""
":class:`.time` objects are also supported by generic function :func:`copy."
"replace`."
msgstr "泛型函式 :func:`copy.replace` 也支援 :class:`.time` 物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2008
msgid "Return a string representing the time in ISO 8601 format, one of:"
msgstr "回傳一個以 ISO 8601 格式表示時間的字串，為下列其中之一："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2010
msgid "``HH:MM:SS.ffffff``, if :attr:`microsecond` is not 0"
msgstr "``HH:MM:SS.ffffff``，如果 :attr:`microsecond` 不是 0"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2011
msgid "``HH:MM:SS``, if :attr:`microsecond` is 0"
msgstr "``HH:MM:SS``，如果 :attr:`microsecond` 是 0"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2012
msgid ""
"``HH:MM:SS.ffffff+HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]``, if :meth:`utcoffset` does not "
"return ``None``"
msgstr ""
"``HH:MM:SS.ffffff+HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]``，如果 :meth:`utcoffset` 沒有回傳 "
"``None``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2013
msgid ""
"``HH:MM:SS+HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]``, if :attr:`microsecond` is 0 and :meth:"
"`utcoffset` does not return ``None``"
msgstr ""
"``HH:MM:SS+HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]``，如果 :attr:`microsecond` 是 0 且 :meth:"
"`utcoffset` 沒有回傳 ``None``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2033
msgid ":exc:`ValueError` will be raised on an invalid *timespec* argument."
msgstr "若 *timespec* 引數無效，會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2037
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.time(hour=12, minute=34, second=56, microsecond=123456)."
"isoformat(timespec='minutes')\n"
"'12:34'\n"
">>> my_time = dt.time(hour=12, minute=34, second=56, microsecond=0)\n"
">>> my_time.isoformat(timespec='microseconds')\n"
"'12:34:56.000000'\n"
">>> my_time.isoformat(timespec='auto')\n"
"'12:34:56'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> dt.time(hour=12, minute=34, second=56, microsecond=123456)."
"isoformat(timespec='minutes')\n"
"'12:34'\n"
">>> my_time = dt.time(hour=12, minute=34, second=56, microsecond=0)\n"
">>> my_time.isoformat(timespec='microseconds')\n"
"'12:34:56.000000'\n"
">>> my_time.isoformat(timespec='auto')\n"
"'12:34:56'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2052
msgid "For a time ``t``, ``str(t)`` is equivalent to ``t.isoformat()``."
msgstr "對於時間 ``t``，``str(t)`` 等價於 ``t.isoformat()``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2057
msgid ""
"Return a string representing the time, controlled by an explicit format "
"string.  See also :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior` and :meth:`time."
"isoformat`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個表示該時間的字串，由明確的格式字串控制。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-"
"strptime-behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`time.isoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2063
msgid ""
"Same as :meth:`.time.strftime`. This makes it possible to specify a format "
"string for a :class:`.time` object in :ref:`formatted string literals <f-"
"strings>` and when using :meth:`str.format`. See also :ref:`strftime-"
"strptime-behavior` and :meth:`time.isoformat`."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`.time.strftime` 相同。這使得在\\ :ref:`格式化字串字面值 <f-"
"strings>`\\ 中以及使用 :meth:`str.format` 時，可以為 :class:`.time` 物件指定"
"格式字串。也請參考 :ref:`strftime-strptime-behavior`\\ 與 :meth:`time."
"isoformat`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2071
msgid ""
"If :attr:`.tzinfo` is ``None``, returns ``None``, else returns ``self.tzinfo."
"utcoffset(None)``, and raises an exception if the latter doesn't return "
"``None`` or a :class:`timedelta` object with magnitude less than one day."
msgstr ""
"如果 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``，則回傳 ``None``，否則回傳 ``self.tzinfo."
"utcoffset(None)``；如果後者回傳的不是 ``None`` 或絕對值小於一天的 :class:"
"`timedelta` 物件，則會引發例外。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2081
msgid ""
"If :attr:`.tzinfo` is ``None``, returns ``None``, else returns ``self.tzinfo."
"dst(None)``, and raises an exception if the latter doesn't return ``None``, "
"or a :class:`timedelta` object with magnitude less than one day."
msgstr ""
"如果 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``，則回傳 ``None``，否則回傳 ``self.tzinfo."
"dst(None)``；如果後者回傳的不是 ``None`` 或絕對值小於一天的 :class:"
"`timedelta` 物件，則會引發例外。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2091
msgid ""
"If :attr:`.tzinfo` is ``None``, returns ``None``, else returns ``self.tzinfo."
"tzname(None)``, or raises an exception if the latter doesn't return ``None`` "
"or a string object."
msgstr ""
"如果 :attr:`.tzinfo` 為 ``None``，則回傳 ``None``，否則回傳 ``self.tzinfo."
"tzname(None)``；如果後者回傳的不是 ``None`` 或字串物件，則會引發例外。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2097
msgid "Examples of usage: :class:`!time`"
msgstr "用法範例：:class:`!time`"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2099
msgid "Examples of working with a :class:`.time` object::"
msgstr "使用 :class:`.time` 物件的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2101
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> class TZ1(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"...     def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"...         return dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"...     def dst(self, when):\n"
"...         return dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"...     def tzname(self, when):\n"
"...         return \"+01:00\"\n"
"...     def  __repr__(self):\n"
"...         return f\"{self.__class__.__name__}()\"\n"
"...\n"
">>> t = dt.time(12, 10, 30, tzinfo=TZ1())\n"
">>> t\n"
"datetime.time(12, 10, 30, tzinfo=TZ1())\n"
">>> t.isoformat()\n"
"'12:10:30+01:00'\n"
">>> t.dst()\n"
"datetime.timedelta(0)\n"
">>> t.tzname()\n"
"'+01:00'\n"
">>> t.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S %Z\")\n"
"'12:10:30 +01:00'\n"
">>> 'The {} is {:%H:%M}.'.format(\"time\", t)\n"
"'The time is 12:10.'"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> class TZ1(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"...     def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"...         return dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"...     def dst(self, when):\n"
"...         return dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"...     def tzname(self, when):\n"
"...         return \"+01:00\"\n"
"...     def  __repr__(self):\n"
"...         return f\"{self.__class__.__name__}()\"\n"
"...\n"
">>> t = dt.time(12, 10, 30, tzinfo=TZ1())\n"
">>> t\n"
"datetime.time(12, 10, 30, tzinfo=TZ1())\n"
">>> t.isoformat()\n"
"'12:10:30+01:00'\n"
">>> t.dst()\n"
"datetime.timedelta(0)\n"
">>> t.tzname()\n"
"'+01:00'\n"
">>> t.strftime(\"%H:%M:%S %Z\")\n"
"'12:10:30 +01:00'\n"
">>> 'The {} is {:%H:%M}.'.format(\"time\", t)\n"
"'The time is 12:10.'"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2130
msgid ":class:`!tzinfo` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!tzinfo` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2134
msgid ""
"This is an :term:`abstract base class`, meaning that this class should not "
"be instantiated directly.  Define a subclass of :class:`tzinfo` to capture "
"information about a particular time zone."
msgstr ""
"這是一個\\ :term:`抽象基底類別 <abstract base class>`，意即這個類別不應該直接"
"被實例化。請定義 :class:`tzinfo` 的子類別來記錄特定時區的資訊。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2138
msgid ""
"An instance of (a concrete subclass of) :class:`tzinfo` can be passed to the "
"constructors for :class:`.datetime` and :class:`.time` objects. The latter "
"objects view their attributes as being in local time, and the :class:`!"
"tzinfo` object supports methods revealing offset of local time from UTC, the "
"name of the time zone, and DST offset, all relative to a date or time object "
"passed to them."
msgstr ""
":class:`tzinfo`\\ （的具體子類別）的實例可以被傳入 :class:`.datetime` 與 :"
"class:`.time` 物件的建構函式。後者會將其屬性視為本地時間，而 :class:`!"
"tzinfo` 物件則提供一些方法，用來取得本地時間與 UTC 的偏移量、時區名稱以及 "
"DST 偏移，這些都是相對於傳入的日期或時間物件而言。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2144
msgid ""
"You need to derive a concrete subclass, and (at least) supply "
"implementations of the standard :class:`tzinfo` methods needed by the :class:"
"`.datetime` methods you use. The :mod:`!datetime` module provides :class:"
"`timezone`, a simple concrete subclass of :class:`!tzinfo` which can "
"represent time zones with fixed offset from UTC such as UTC itself or North "
"American EST and EDT."
msgstr ""
"你需要衍生出一個具體子類別，並（至少）實作你所使用的 :class:`.datetime` 方法"
"所需要的標準 :class:`tzinfo` 方法。:mod:`!datetime` 模組提供了 :class:"
"`timezone`，它是 :class:`!tzinfo` 的一個簡單具體子類別，可以表示與 UTC 有固定"
"偏移量的時區，例如 UTC 本身或北美的 EST 與 EDT。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2151
msgid ""
"Special requirement for pickling:  A :class:`tzinfo` subclass must have an :"
"meth:`~object.__init__` method that can be called with no arguments, "
"otherwise it can be pickled but possibly not unpickled again. This is a "
"technical requirement that may be relaxed in the future."
msgstr ""
"封裝的特殊需求：:class:`tzinfo` 子類別必須有一個可以不帶引數呼叫的 :meth:"
"`~object.__init__` 方法，否則它雖然可以被封裝，但可能無法再被拆封。這是一個技"
"術上的要求，未來可能會放寬。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2157
msgid ""
"A concrete subclass of :class:`tzinfo` may need to implement the following "
"methods. Exactly which methods are needed depends on the uses made of aware :"
"mod:`!datetime` objects. If in doubt, simply implement all of them."
msgstr ""
":class:`tzinfo` 的具體子類別可能需要實作以下方法。確切需要哪些方法取決於 "
"aware 的 :mod:`!datetime` 物件的使用方式。如果不確定，就全部實作。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2164
msgid ""
"Return offset of local time from UTC, as a :class:`timedelta` object that is "
"positive east of UTC. If local time is west of UTC, this should be negative."
msgstr ""
"以 :class:`timedelta` 物件回傳本地時間與 UTC 的偏移量，在 UTC 以東為正值。如"
"果本地時間在 UTC 以西，則應為負值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2167
msgid ""
"This represents the *total* offset from UTC; for example, if a :class:"
"`tzinfo` object represents both time zone and DST adjustments, :meth:"
"`utcoffset` should return their sum. If the UTC offset isn't known, return "
"``None``. Else the value returned must be a :class:`timedelta` object "
"strictly between ``-timedelta(hours=24)`` and ``timedelta(hours=24)`` (the "
"magnitude of the offset must be less than one day). Most implementations of :"
"meth:`utcoffset` will probably look like one of these two::"
msgstr ""
"這代表與 UTC 的\\ *總*\\ 偏移量；舉例來說，如果一個 :class:`tzinfo` 物件同時"
"表示時區與 DST 調整，:meth:`utcoffset` 應該回傳兩者的總和。如果 UTC 偏移未"
"知，則回傳 ``None``。否則回傳的值必須是一個嚴格介於 ``-timedelta(hours=24)`` "
"與 ``timedelta(hours=24)`` 之間的 :class:`timedelta` 物件（偏移量的絕對值必須"
"小於一天）。大多數 :meth:`utcoffset` 的實作大概會長得像以下兩種之一： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2175
msgid ""
"return CONSTANT                 # fixed-offset class\n"
"return CONSTANT + self.dst(dt)  # daylight-aware class"
msgstr ""
"return CONSTANT                 # 固定偏移量的類別\n"
"return CONSTANT + self.dst(dt)  # 考量日光節約時間的類別"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2178
msgid ""
"If :meth:`utcoffset` does not return ``None``, :meth:`dst` should not return "
"``None`` either."
msgstr ""
"如果 :meth:`utcoffset` 沒有回傳 ``None``，:meth:`dst` 也不應該回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2181
msgid ""
"The default implementation of :meth:`utcoffset` raises :exc:"
"`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ":meth:`utcoffset` 的預設實作會引發 :exc:`NotImplementedError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2190
msgid ""
"Return the daylight saving time (DST) adjustment, as a :class:`timedelta` "
"object or ``None`` if DST information isn't known."
msgstr ""
"以 :class:`timedelta` 物件回傳日光節約時間 (DST) 的調整量，如果 DST 資訊未知"
"則回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2194
msgid ""
"Return ``timedelta(0)`` if DST is not in effect. If DST is in effect, return "
"the offset as a :class:`timedelta` object (see :meth:`utcoffset` for "
"details). Note that DST offset, if applicable, has already been added to the "
"UTC offset returned by :meth:`utcoffset`, so there's no need to consult :"
"meth:`dst` unless you're interested in obtaining DST info separately. For "
"example, :meth:`datetime.timetuple` calls its :attr:`~.datetime.tzinfo` "
"attribute's :meth:`dst` method to determine how the :attr:`~time.struct_time."
"tm_isdst` flag should be set, and :meth:`tzinfo.fromutc` calls :meth:`dst` "
"to account for DST changes when crossing time zones."
msgstr ""
"如果 DST 未生效，則回傳 ``timedelta(0)``。如果 DST 生效，則以 :class:"
"`timedelta` 物件回傳偏移量（詳情請見 :meth:`utcoffset`）。請注意，DST 偏移"
"（如果適用的話）已經被加到 :meth:`utcoffset` 所回傳的 UTC 偏移中，所以除非你"
"想單獨取得 DST 資訊，否則不需要查詢 :meth:`dst`。例如，:meth:`datetime."
"timetuple` 會呼叫其 :attr:`~.datetime.tzinfo` 屬性的 :meth:`dst` 方法來決定 :"
"attr:`~time.struct_time.tm_isdst` 旗標應如何設定，而 :meth:`tzinfo.fromutc` "
"會呼叫 :meth:`dst`，以便在跨越時區時考量 DST 的變化。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2204
msgid ""
"An instance *tz* of a :class:`tzinfo` subclass that models both standard and "
"daylight times must be consistent in this sense:"
msgstr ""
"一個同時處理標準時間與日光節約時間的 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別實例 *tz*，必須在"
"以下這點上保持一致："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2207
msgid "``tz.utcoffset(dt) - tz.dst(dt)``"
msgstr "``tz.utcoffset(dt) - tz.dst(dt)``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2209
msgid ""
"must return the same result for every :class:`.datetime` *dt* with ``dt."
"tzinfo == tz``. For sane :class:`!tzinfo` subclasses, this expression yields "
"the time zone's \"standard offset\", which should not depend on the date or "
"the time, but only on geographic location. The implementation of :meth:"
"`datetime.astimezone` relies on this, but cannot detect violations; it's the "
"programmer's responsibility to ensure it. If a :class:`!tzinfo` subclass "
"cannot guarantee this, it may be able to override the default implementation "
"of :meth:`tzinfo.fromutc` to work correctly with :meth:`~.datetime."
"astimezone` regardless."
msgstr ""
"對於每個 ``dt.tzinfo == tz`` 的 :class:`.datetime` *dt*，都必須回傳相同的結"
"果。對於合理的 :class:`!tzinfo` 子類別，此運算式會產生該時區的「標準偏移"
"量」，它不應取決於日期或時間，而只取決於地理位置。:meth:`datetime."
"astimezone` 的實作依賴於此，但無法偵測違反的情況；確保這一點是程式設計師的責"
"任。如果 :class:`!tzinfo` 子類別無法保證這一點，它或許可以覆寫 :meth:`tzinfo."
"fromutc` 的預設實作，使其無論如何都能與 :meth:`~.datetime.astimezone` 正確搭"
"配運作。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2218
msgid ""
"Most implementations of :meth:`dst` will probably look like one of these "
"two::"
msgstr "大多數 :meth:`dst` 的實作大概會長得像以下兩種之一： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2220
msgid ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def dst(self, when):\n"
"    # a fixed-offset class:  doesn't account for DST\n"
"    return dt.timedelta(0)"
msgstr ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def dst(self, when):\n"
"    # 固定偏移量的類別：不考量 DST\n"
"    return dt.timedelta(0)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2226
msgid "or::"
msgstr "或是： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2228
msgid ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def dst(self, when):\n"
"    # Code to set dston and dstoff to the time zone's DST\n"
"    # transition times based on the input when.year, and expressed\n"
"    # in standard local time.\n"
"\n"
"    if dston <= when.replace(tzinfo=None) < dstoff:\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(0)"
msgstr ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def dst(self, when):\n"
"    # 此處的程式碼依據輸入的 when.year，將 dston 與 dstoff 設為\n"
"    # 該時區的 DST 轉換時間（以本地標準時間表示）。\n"
"\n"
"    if dston <= when.replace(tzinfo=None) < dstoff:\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return dt.timedelta(0)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2240
msgid ""
"The default implementation of :meth:`dst` raises :exc:`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ":meth:`dst` 的預設實作會引發 :exc:`NotImplementedError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2248
msgid ""
"Return the time zone name corresponding to the :class:`.datetime` object "
"*dt*, as a string. Nothing about string names is defined by the :mod:`!"
"datetime` module, and there's no requirement that it mean anything in "
"particular. For example, ``\"GMT\"``, ``\"UTC\"``, ``\"-500\"``, "
"``\"-5:00\"``, ``\"EDT\"``, ``\"US/Eastern\"``, ``\"America/New York\"`` are "
"all valid replies. Return ``None`` if a string name isn't known. Note that "
"this is a method rather than a fixed string primarily because some :class:"
"`tzinfo` subclasses will wish to return different names depending on the "
"specific value of *dt* passed, especially if the :class:`!tzinfo` class is "
"accounting for daylight time."
msgstr ""
"以字串回傳 :class:`.datetime` 物件 *dt* 所對應的時區名稱。:mod:`!datetime` 模"
"組沒有對字串名稱做任何定義，也不要求它具有任何特定含義。例如 ``\"GMT\"``、"
"``\"UTC\"``、``\"-500\"``、``\"-5:00\"``、``\"EDT\"``、``\"US/Eastern\"``、"
"``\"America/New York\"`` 都是有效的回傳值。如果字串名稱未知，則回傳 "
"``None``。請注意，這之所以是一個方法而不是固定字串，主要是因為某些 :class:"
"`tzinfo` 子類別會希望根據傳入的 *dt* 的特定值回傳不同的名稱，特別是當 :class:"
"`!tzinfo` 類別有考量日光節約時間時。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2258
msgid ""
"The default implementation of :meth:`tzname` raises :exc:"
"`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ":meth:`tzname` 的預設實作會引發 :exc:`NotImplementedError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2261
msgid ""
"These methods are called by a :class:`.datetime` or :class:`.time` object, "
"in response to their methods of the same names. A :class:`!datetime` object "
"passes itself as the argument, and a :class:`!time` object passes ``None`` "
"as the argument. A :class:`tzinfo` subclass's methods should therefore be "
"prepared to accept a *dt* argument of ``None``, or of class :class:`!"
"datetime`."
msgstr ""
"這些方法會由 :class:`.datetime` 或 :class:`.time` 物件呼叫，以回應它們自身的"
"同名方法。:class:`!datetime` 物件會將自己作為引數傳入，而 :class:`!time` 物件"
"則傳入 ``None`` 作為引數。因此，:class:`tzinfo` 子類別的方法應該準備好接受值"
"為 ``None`` 或類別為 :class:`!datetime` 的 *dt* 引數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2267
msgid ""
"When ``None`` is passed, it's up to the class designer to decide the best "
"response. For example, returning ``None`` is appropriate if the class wishes "
"to say that time objects don't participate in the :class:`tzinfo` protocols. "
"It may be more useful for ``utcoffset(None)`` to return the standard UTC "
"offset, as there is no other convention for discovering the standard offset."
msgstr ""
"當傳入 ``None`` 時，由類別的設計者決定最佳的回應方式。例如，如果類別希望表示 "
"time 物件不參與 :class:`tzinfo` 協定，回傳 ``None`` 是合適的做法。讓 "
"``utcoffset(None)`` 回傳標準 UTC 偏移可能會更有用，因為沒有其他慣例可以用來得"
"知標準偏移量。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2273
msgid ""
"When a :class:`.datetime` object is passed in response to a :class:`!"
"datetime` method, ``dt.tzinfo`` is the same object as *self*. :class:"
"`tzinfo` methods can rely on this, unless user code calls :class:`!tzinfo` "
"methods directly. The intent is that the :class:`!tzinfo` methods interpret "
"*dt* as being in local time, and not need worry about objects in other time "
"zones."
msgstr ""
"當 :class:`.datetime` 物件為了回應 :class:`!datetime` 方法而被傳入時，``dt."
"tzinfo`` 與 *self* 是同一個物件。除非使用者程式碼直接呼叫 :class:`!tzinfo` 方"
"法，否則 :class:`tzinfo` 方法可以依賴這一點。這樣設計的用意是讓 :class:`!"
"tzinfo` 方法將 *dt* 解讀為本地時間，而不需要擔心其他時區的物件。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2279
msgid ""
"There is one more :class:`tzinfo` method that a subclass may wish to "
"override:"
msgstr "子類別可能會想覆寫的 :class:`tzinfo` 方法還有一個："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2284
msgid ""
"This is called from the default :meth:`datetime.astimezone` implementation. "
"When called from that, ``dt.tzinfo`` is *self*, and *dt*'s date and time "
"data are to be viewed as expressing a UTC time. The purpose of :meth:"
"`fromutc` is to adjust the date and time data, returning an equivalent "
"datetime in *self*'s local time."
msgstr ""
"此方法會由預設的 :meth:`datetime.astimezone` 實作呼叫。從該處呼叫時，``dt."
"tzinfo`` 為 *self*，且 *dt* 的日期與時間資料應被視為表示一個 UTC 時間。:meth:"
"`fromutc` 的目的是調整日期與時間資料，回傳一個以 *self* 的本地時間表示的等價 "
"datetime。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2290
msgid ""
"Most :class:`tzinfo` subclasses should be able to inherit the default :meth:"
"`fromutc` implementation without problems. It's strong enough to handle "
"fixed-offset time zones, and time zones accounting for both standard and "
"daylight time, and the latter even if the DST transition times differ in "
"different years. An example of a time zone the default :meth:`fromutc` "
"implementation may not handle correctly in all cases is one where the "
"standard offset (from UTC) depends on the specific date and time passed, "
"which can happen for political reasons. The default implementations of :meth:"
"`~.datetime.astimezone` and :meth:`fromutc` may not produce the result you "
"want if the result is one of the hours straddling the moment the standard "
"offset changes."
msgstr ""
"大多數 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別應該都能毫無問題地繼承預設的 :meth:`fromutc` 實"
"作。它足以處理固定偏移量的時區，以及同時考量標準時間與日光節約時間的時區，而"
"且即使後者的 DST 轉換時間在不同年份有所不同也能處理。預設的 :meth:`fromutc` "
"實作可能無法在所有情況下都正確處理的一個例子，是標準偏移量（相對於 UTC）取決"
"於傳入的特定日期與時間的時區，這可能因政治因素而發生。如果結果恰好是跨越標準"
"偏移量變更時刻的那幾個小時之一，:meth:`~.datetime.astimezone` 與 :meth:"
"`fromutc` 的預設實作可能不會產生你想要的結果。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2301
msgid ""
"Skipping code for error cases, the default :meth:`fromutc` implementation "
"acts like::"
msgstr "若略過處理錯誤情況的程式碼，預設的 :meth:`fromutc` 實作大致如下： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2304
msgid ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"    # raise ValueError error if when.tzinfo is not self\n"
"    dtoff = when.utcoffset()\n"
"    dtdst = when.dst()\n"
"    # raise ValueError if dtoff is None or dtdst is None\n"
"    delta = dtoff - dtdst  # this is self's standard offset\n"
"    if delta:\n"
"        when += delta   # convert to standard local time\n"
"        dtdst = when.dst()\n"
"        # raise ValueError if dtdst is None\n"
"    if dtdst:\n"
"        return when + dtdst\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return when"
msgstr ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"    # 若 when.tzinfo 不是 self 則引發 ValueError\n"
"    dtoff = when.utcoffset()\n"
"    dtdst = when.dst()\n"
"    # 若 dtoff 為 None 或 dtdst 為 None 則引發 ValueError\n"
"    delta = dtoff - dtdst  # 這是 self 的標準偏移量\n"
"    if delta:\n"
"        when += delta   # 轉換為本地標準時間\n"
"        dtdst = when.dst()\n"
"        # 若 dtdst 為 None 則引發 ValueError\n"
"    if dtdst:\n"
"        return when + dtdst\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return when"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2321
msgid ""
"In the following :download:`tzinfo_examples.py <../includes/tzinfo_examples."
"py>` file there are some examples of :class:`tzinfo` classes:"
msgstr ""
"以下的 :download:`tzinfo_examples.py <../includes/tzinfo_examples.py>` 檔案中"
"有一些 :class:`tzinfo` 類別的範例："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2325
msgid ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"# A class capturing the platform's idea of local time.\n"
"# (May result in wrong values on historical times in\n"
"#  timezones where UTC offset and/or the DST rules had\n"
"#  changed in the past.)\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"ZERO = dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"HOUR = dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"SECOND = dt.timedelta(seconds=1)\n"
"\n"
"STDOFFSET = dt.timedelta(seconds=-time.timezone)\n"
"if time.daylight:\n"
"    DSTOFFSET = dt.timedelta(seconds=-time.altzone)\n"
"else:\n"
"    DSTOFFSET = STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"DSTDIFF = DSTOFFSET - STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class LocalTimezone(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        stamp = (when - dt.datetime(1970, 1, 1, tzinfo=self)) // SECOND\n"
"        args = time.localtime(stamp)[:6]\n"
"        dst_diff = DSTDIFF // SECOND\n"
"        # Detect fold\n"
"        fold = (args == time.localtime(stamp - dst_diff))\n"
"        return dt.datetime(*args, microsecond=when.microsecond,\n"
"                           tzinfo=self, fold=fold)\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        if self._isdst(when):\n"
"            return DSTOFFSET\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        if self._isdst(when):\n"
"            return DSTDIFF\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return ZERO\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        return time.tzname[self._isdst(when)]\n"
"\n"
"    def _isdst(self, when):\n"
"        tt = (when.year, when.month, when.day,\n"
"              when.hour, when.minute, when.second,\n"
"              when.weekday(), 0, 0)\n"
"        stamp = time.mktime(tt)\n"
"        tt = time.localtime(stamp)\n"
"        return tt.tm_isdst > 0\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Local = LocalTimezone()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# A complete implementation of current DST rules for major US time zones.\n"
"\n"
"def first_sunday_on_or_after(when):\n"
"    days_to_go = 6 - when.weekday()\n"
"    if days_to_go:\n"
"        when += dt.timedelta(days_to_go)\n"
"    return when\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# US DST Rules\n"
"#\n"
"# This is a simplified (i.e., wrong for a few cases) set of rules for US\n"
"# DST start and end times. For a complete and up-to-date set of DST rules\n"
"# and timezone definitions, visit the Olson Database (or try pytz):\n"
"# http://www.twinsun.com/tz/tz-link.htm\n"
"# https://sourceforge.net/projects/pytz/ (might not be up-to-date)\n"
"#\n"
"# In the US, since 2007, DST starts at 2am (standard time) on the second\n"
"# Sunday in March, which is the first Sunday on or after Mar 8.\n"
"DSTSTART_2007 = dt.datetime(1, 3, 8, 2)\n"
"# and ends at 2am (DST time) on the first Sunday of Nov.\n"
"DSTEND_2007 = dt.datetime(1, 11, 1, 2)\n"
"# From 1987 to 2006, DST used to start at 2am (standard time) on the first\n"
"# Sunday in April and to end at 2am (DST time) on the last\n"
"# Sunday of October, which is the first Sunday on or after Oct 25.\n"
"DSTSTART_1987_2006 = dt.datetime(1, 4, 1, 2)\n"
"DSTEND_1987_2006 = dt.datetime(1, 10, 25, 2)\n"
"# From 1967 to 1986, DST used to start at 2am (standard time) on the last\n"
"# Sunday in April (the one on or after April 24) and to end at 2am (DST "
"time)\n"
"# on the last Sunday of October, which is the first Sunday\n"
"# on or after Oct 25.\n"
"DSTSTART_1967_1986 = dt.datetime(1, 4, 24, 2)\n"
"DSTEND_1967_1986 = DSTEND_1987_2006\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def us_dst_range(year):\n"
"    # Find start and end times for US DST. For years before 1967, return\n"
"    # start = end for no DST.\n"
"    if 2006 < year:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_2007, DSTEND_2007\n"
"    elif 1986 < year < 2007:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_1987_2006, DSTEND_1987_2006\n"
"    elif 1966 < year < 1987:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_1967_1986, DSTEND_1967_1986\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return (dt.datetime(year, 1, 1), ) * 2\n"
"\n"
"    start = first_sunday_on_or_after(dststart.replace(year=year))\n"
"    end = first_sunday_on_or_after(dstend.replace(year=year))\n"
"    return start, end\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class USTimeZone(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"\n"
"    def __init__(self, hours, reprname, stdname, dstname):\n"
"        self.stdoffset = dt.timedelta(hours=hours)\n"
"        self.reprname = reprname\n"
"        self.stdname = stdname\n"
"        self.dstname = dstname\n"
"\n"
"    def __repr__(self):\n"
"        return self.reprname\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        if self.dst(when):\n"
"            return self.dstname\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return self.stdname\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        return self.stdoffset + self.dst(when)\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        if when is None or when.tzinfo is None:\n"
"            # An exception may be sensible here, in one or both cases.\n"
"            # It depends on how you want to treat them.  The default\n"
"            # fromutc() implementation (called by the default astimezone()\n"
"            # implementation) passes a datetime with when.tzinfo is self.\n"
"            return ZERO\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        start, end = us_dst_range(when.year)\n"
"        # Can't compare naive to aware objects, so strip the timezone from\n"
"        # when first.\n"
"        when = when.replace(tzinfo=None)\n"
"        if start + HOUR <= when < end - HOUR:\n"
"            # DST is in effect.\n"
"            return HOUR\n"
"        if end - HOUR <= when < end:\n"
"            # Fold (an ambiguous hour): use when.fold to disambiguate.\n"
"            return ZERO if when.fold else HOUR\n"
"        if start <= when < start + HOUR:\n"
"            # Gap (a non-existent hour): reverse the fold rule.\n"
"            return HOUR if when.fold else ZERO\n"
"        # DST is off.\n"
"        return ZERO\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        start, end = us_dst_range(when.year)\n"
"        start = start.replace(tzinfo=self)\n"
"        end = end.replace(tzinfo=self)\n"
"        std_time = when + self.stdoffset\n"
"        dst_time = std_time + HOUR\n"
"        if end <= dst_time < end + HOUR:\n"
"            # Repeated hour\n"
"            return std_time.replace(fold=1)\n"
"        if std_time < start or dst_time >= end:\n"
"            # Standard time\n"
"            return std_time\n"
"        if start <= std_time < end - HOUR:\n"
"            # Daylight saving time\n"
"            return dst_time\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Eastern  = USTimeZone(-5, \"Eastern\",  \"EST\", \"EDT\")\n"
"Central  = USTimeZone(-6, \"Central\",  \"CST\", \"CDT\")\n"
"Mountain = USTimeZone(-7, \"Mountain\", \"MST\", \"MDT\")\n"
"Pacific  = USTimeZone(-8, \"Pacific\",  \"PST\", \"PDT\")\n"
msgstr ""
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"# 一個反映平台對本地時間認知的類別。\n"
"# （對於 UTC 偏移和/或 DST 規則曾經變更過的時區，\n"
"#  在歷史時間上可能會得到錯誤的值。）\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"ZERO = dt.timedelta(0)\n"
"HOUR = dt.timedelta(hours=1)\n"
"SECOND = dt.timedelta(seconds=1)\n"
"\n"
"STDOFFSET = dt.timedelta(seconds=-time.timezone)\n"
"if time.daylight:\n"
"    DSTOFFSET = dt.timedelta(seconds=-time.altzone)\n"
"else:\n"
"    DSTOFFSET = STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"DSTDIFF = DSTOFFSET - STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class LocalTimezone(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        stamp = (when - dt.datetime(1970, 1, 1, tzinfo=self)) // SECOND\n"
"        args = time.localtime(stamp)[:6]\n"
"        dst_diff = DSTDIFF // SECOND\n"
"        # 偵測 fold\n"
"        fold = (args == time.localtime(stamp - dst_diff))\n"
"        return dt.datetime(*args, microsecond=when.microsecond,\n"
"                           tzinfo=self, fold=fold)\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        if self._isdst(when):\n"
"            return DSTOFFSET\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return STDOFFSET\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        if self._isdst(when):\n"
"            return DSTDIFF\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return ZERO\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        return time.tzname[self._isdst(when)]\n"
"\n"
"    def _isdst(self, when):\n"
"        tt = (when.year, when.month, when.day,\n"
"              when.hour, when.minute, when.second,\n"
"              when.weekday(), 0, 0)\n"
"        stamp = time.mktime(tt)\n"
"        tt = time.localtime(stamp)\n"
"        return tt.tm_isdst > 0\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Local = LocalTimezone()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# 美國主要時區目前 DST 規則的完整實作。\n"
"\n"
"def first_sunday_on_or_after(when):\n"
"    days_to_go = 6 - when.weekday()\n"
"    if days_to_go:\n"
"        when += dt.timedelta(days_to_go)\n"
"    return when\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"# 美國 DST 規則\n"
"#\n"
"# 這是一組簡化過（也就是在少數情況下是錯的）的美國 DST 開始與結束\n"
"# 時間規則。完整且最新的 DST 規則與時區定義，請參考 Olson 資料庫\n"
"# （或試試 pytz）：\n"
"# http://www.twinsun.com/tz/tz-link.htm\n"
"# https://sourceforge.net/projects/pytz/ （可能不是最新的）\n"
"#\n"
"# 在美國，自 2007 年起，DST 從三月的第二個星期日凌晨 2 點（標準時間）\n"
"# 開始，也就是 3 月 8 日當天或之後的第一個星期日。\n"
"DSTSTART_2007 = dt.datetime(1, 3, 8, 2)\n"
"# 並在十一月的第一個星期日凌晨 2 點（DST 時間）結束。\n"
"DSTEND_2007 = dt.datetime(1, 11, 1, 2)\n"
"# 從 1987 年到 2006 年，DST 從四月的第一個星期日凌晨 2 點（標準時間）\n"
"# 開始，並在十月的最後一個星期日凌晨 2 點（DST 時間）結束，\n"
"# 也就是 10 月 25 日當天或之後的第一個星期日。\n"
"DSTSTART_1987_2006 = dt.datetime(1, 4, 1, 2)\n"
"DSTEND_1987_2006 = dt.datetime(1, 10, 25, 2)\n"
"# 從 1967 年到 1986 年，DST 從四月的最後一個星期日（4 月 24 日當天或\n"
"# 之後的那一個）凌晨 2 點（標準時間）開始，並在十月的最後一個\n"
"# 星期日凌晨 2 點（DST 時間）結束，也就是 10 月 25 日當天或之後的\n"
"# 第一個星期日。\n"
"DSTSTART_1967_1986 = dt.datetime(1, 4, 24, 2)\n"
"DSTEND_1967_1986 = DSTEND_1987_2006\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"def us_dst_range(year):\n"
"    # 找出美國 DST 的開始與結束時間。對於 1967 年以前的年份，\n"
"    # 回傳 start = end 表示沒有 DST。\n"
"    if 2006 < year:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_2007, DSTEND_2007\n"
"    elif 1986 < year < 2007:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_1987_2006, DSTEND_1987_2006\n"
"    elif 1966 < year < 1987:\n"
"        dststart, dstend = DSTSTART_1967_1986, DSTEND_1967_1986\n"
"    else:\n"
"        return (dt.datetime(year, 1, 1), ) * 2\n"
"\n"
"    start = first_sunday_on_or_after(dststart.replace(year=year))\n"
"    end = first_sunday_on_or_after(dstend.replace(year=year))\n"
"    return start, end\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class USTimeZone(dt.tzinfo):\n"
"\n"
"    def __init__(self, hours, reprname, stdname, dstname):\n"
"        self.stdoffset = dt.timedelta(hours=hours)\n"
"        self.reprname = reprname\n"
"        self.stdname = stdname\n"
"        self.dstname = dstname\n"
"\n"
"    def __repr__(self):\n"
"        return self.reprname\n"
"\n"
"    def tzname(self, when):\n"
"        if self.dst(when):\n"
"            return self.dstname\n"
"        else:\n"
"            return self.stdname\n"
"\n"
"    def utcoffset(self, when):\n"
"        return self.stdoffset + self.dst(when)\n"
"\n"
"    def dst(self, when):\n"
"        if when is None or when.tzinfo is None:\n"
"            # 在其中一種或兩種情況下，在這裡引發例外可能是合理的，\n"
"            # 取決於你想如何處理它們。預設的 fromutc() 實作\n"
"            # （由預設的 astimezone() 實作所呼叫）會傳入一個\n"
"            # when.tzinfo 為 self 的 datetime。\n"
"            return ZERO\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        start, end = us_dst_range(when.year)\n"
"        # 無法比較 naive 與 aware 物件，所以先移除 when 的時區。\n"
"        when = when.replace(tzinfo=None)\n"
"        if start + HOUR <= when < end - HOUR:\n"
"            # DST 生效中。\n"
"            return HOUR\n"
"        if end - HOUR <= when < end:\n"
"            # Fold（有歧義的一小時）：用 when.fold 來消除歧義。\n"
"            return ZERO if when.fold else HOUR\n"
"        if start <= when < start + HOUR:\n"
"            # Gap（不存在的一小時）：反轉 fold 規則。\n"
"            return HOUR if when.fold else ZERO\n"
"        # DST 未生效。\n"
"        return ZERO\n"
"\n"
"    def fromutc(self, when):\n"
"        assert when.tzinfo is self\n"
"        start, end = us_dst_range(when.year)\n"
"        start = start.replace(tzinfo=self)\n"
"        end = end.replace(tzinfo=self)\n"
"        std_time = when + self.stdoffset\n"
"        dst_time = std_time + HOUR\n"
"        if end <= dst_time < end + HOUR:\n"
"            # 重複的一小時\n"
"            return std_time.replace(fold=1)\n"
"        if std_time < start or dst_time >= end:\n"
"            # 標準時間\n"
"            return std_time\n"
"        if start <= std_time < end - HOUR:\n"
"            # 日光節約時間\n"
"            return dst_time\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Eastern  = USTimeZone(-5, \"Eastern\",  \"EST\", \"EDT\")\n"
"Central  = USTimeZone(-6, \"Central\",  \"CST\", \"CDT\")\n"
"Mountain = USTimeZone(-7, \"Mountain\", \"MST\", \"MDT\")\n"
"Pacific  = USTimeZone(-8, \"Pacific\",  \"PST\", \"PDT\")\n"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2327
msgid ""
"Note that there are unavoidable subtleties twice per year in a :class:"
"`tzinfo` subclass accounting for both standard and daylight time, at the DST "
"transition points. For concreteness, consider US Eastern (UTC -0500), where "
"EDT begins the minute after 1:59 (EST) on the second Sunday in March, and "
"ends the minute after 1:59 (EDT) on the first Sunday in November::"
msgstr ""
"請注意，在同時考量標準時間與日光節約時間的 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別中，每年會有"
"兩次在 DST 轉換點上無法避免的微妙問題。具體來說，以美國東部時間 (UTC -0500) "
"為例，EDT 從三月第二個星期日的 1:59 (EST) 之後的那一分鐘開始，並在十一月第一"
"個星期日的 1:59 (EDT) 之後的那一分鐘結束： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2333
msgid ""
"  UTC   3:MM  4:MM  5:MM  6:MM  7:MM  8:MM\n"
"  EST  22:MM 23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM\n"
"  EDT  23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM  4:MM\n"
"\n"
"start  22:MM 23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  3:MM  4:MM\n"
"\n"
"  end  23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM"
msgstr ""
"  UTC   3:MM  4:MM  5:MM  6:MM  7:MM  8:MM\n"
"  EST  22:MM 23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM\n"
"  EDT  23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM  4:MM\n"
"\n"
"start  22:MM 23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  3:MM  4:MM\n"
"\n"
"  end  23:MM  0:MM  1:MM  1:MM  2:MM  3:MM"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2341
msgid ""
"When DST starts (the \"start\" line), the local wall clock leaps from 1:59 "
"to 3:00. A wall time of the form 2:MM doesn't really make sense on that day, "
"so ``astimezone(Eastern)`` won't deliver a result with ``hour == 2`` on the "
"day DST begins. For example, at the Spring forward transition of 2016, we "
"get::"
msgstr ""
"當 DST 開始時（「start」那一列），本地的牆上時鐘 (wall clock) 會從 1:59 跳到 "
"3:00。形式為 2:MM 的牆上時間在那天其實沒有意義，所以在 DST 開始的那天，"
"``astimezone(Eastern)`` 不會產生 ``hour == 2`` 的結果。例如，在 2016 年的「春"
"季撥快」(Spring forward) 轉換時，我們會得到： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2346
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> from tzinfo_examples import HOUR, Eastern\n"
">>> u0 = dt.datetime(2016, 3, 13, 5, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     u = u0 + i*HOUR\n"
"...     t = u.astimezone(Eastern)\n"
"...     print(u.time(), 'UTC =', t.time(), t.tzname())\n"
"...\n"
"05:00:00 UTC = 00:00:00 EST\n"
"06:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EST\n"
"07:00:00 UTC = 03:00:00 EDT\n"
"08:00:00 UTC = 04:00:00 EDT"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> from tzinfo_examples import HOUR, Eastern\n"
">>> u0 = dt.datetime(2016, 3, 13, 5, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     u = u0 + i*HOUR\n"
"...     t = u.astimezone(Eastern)\n"
"...     print(u.time(), 'UTC =', t.time(), t.tzname())\n"
"...\n"
"05:00:00 UTC = 00:00:00 EST\n"
"06:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EST\n"
"07:00:00 UTC = 03:00:00 EDT\n"
"08:00:00 UTC = 04:00:00 EDT"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2360
msgid ""
"When DST ends (the \"end\" line), there's a potentially worse problem: "
"there's an hour that can't be spelled unambiguously in local wall time: the "
"last hour of daylight time. In Eastern, that's times of the form 5:MM UTC on "
"the day daylight time ends. The local wall clock leaps from 1:59 (daylight "
"time) back to 1:00 (standard time) again. Local times of the form 1:MM are "
"ambiguous. :meth:`~.datetime.astimezone` mimics the local clock's behavior "
"by mapping two adjacent UTC hours into the same local hour then. In the "
"Eastern example, UTC times of the form 5:MM and 6:MM both map to 1:MM when "
"converted to Eastern, but earlier times have the :attr:`~.datetime.fold` "
"attribute set to 0 and the later times have it set to 1. For example, at the "
"Fall back transition of 2016, we get::"
msgstr ""
"當 DST 結束時（「end」那一列），會有一個可能更糟的問題：有一個小時無法以本地"
"牆上時間無歧義地表示，也就是日光節約時間的最後一個小時。在東部時間，那是日光"
"節約時間結束當天形式為 5:MM UTC 的時間。本地的牆上時鐘會從 1:59（日光節約時"
"間）再次跳回 1:00（標準時間）。形式為 1:MM 的本地時間是有歧義的。:meth:`~."
"datetime.astimezone` 會模仿本地時鐘的行為，在此時將兩個相鄰的 UTC 小時對映到"
"同一個本地小時。在東部時間的例子中，形式為 5:MM 與 6:MM 的 UTC 時間在轉換為東"
"部時間時都會對映到 1:MM，但較早的時間其 :attr:`~.datetime.fold` 屬性會被設為 "
"0，較晚的時間則會被設為 1。例如，在 2016 年的「秋季撥回」(Fall back) 轉換時，"
"我們會得到： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2371
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> from tzinfo_examples import HOUR, Eastern\n"
">>> u0 = dt.datetime(2016, 11, 6, 4, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     u = u0 + i*HOUR\n"
"...     t = u.astimezone(Eastern)\n"
"...     print(u.time(), 'UTC =', t.time(), t.tzname(), t.fold)\n"
"...\n"
"04:00:00 UTC = 00:00:00 EDT 0\n"
"05:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EDT 0\n"
"06:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EST 1\n"
"07:00:00 UTC = 02:00:00 EST 0"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> from tzinfo_examples import HOUR, Eastern\n"
">>> u0 = dt.datetime(2016, 11, 6, 4, tzinfo=dt.timezone.utc)\n"
">>> for i in range(4):\n"
"...     u = u0 + i*HOUR\n"
"...     t = u.astimezone(Eastern)\n"
"...     print(u.time(), 'UTC =', t.time(), t.tzname(), t.fold)\n"
"...\n"
"04:00:00 UTC = 00:00:00 EDT 0\n"
"05:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EDT 0\n"
"06:00:00 UTC = 01:00:00 EST 1\n"
"07:00:00 UTC = 02:00:00 EST 0"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2384
msgid ""
"Note that the :class:`.datetime` instances that differ only by the value of "
"the :attr:`~.datetime.fold` attribute are considered equal in comparisons."
msgstr ""
"請注意，僅有 :attr:`~.datetime.fold` 屬性值不同的 :class:`.datetime` 實例在比"
"較時會被視為相等。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2387
msgid ""
"Applications that can't bear wall-time ambiguities should explicitly check "
"the value of the :attr:`~.datetime.fold` attribute or avoid using hybrid :"
"class:`tzinfo` subclasses; there are no ambiguities when using :class:"
"`timezone`, or any other fixed-offset :class:`!tzinfo` subclass (such as a "
"class representing only EST (fixed offset -5 hours), or only EDT (fixed "
"offset -4 hours))."
msgstr ""
"無法容忍牆上時間歧義的應用程式應該明確檢查 :attr:`~.datetime.fold` 屬性的值，"
"或避免使用混合式的 :class:`tzinfo` 子類別；使用 :class:`timezone` 或任何其他"
"固定偏移量的 :class:`!tzinfo` 子類別（例如只表示 EST（固定偏移量 -5 小時）或"
"只表示 EDT（固定偏移量 -4 小時）的類別）時則不會有歧義。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2395
msgid ":mod:`zoneinfo`"
msgstr ":mod:`zoneinfo`"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2396
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!datetime` module has a basic :class:`timezone` class (for "
"handling arbitrary fixed offsets from UTC) and its :attr:`timezone.utc` "
"attribute (a UTC :class:`!timezone` instance)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!datetime` 模組有一個基本的 :class:`timezone` 類別（用來處理與 UTC 之間"
"任意的固定偏移量）及其 :attr:`timezone.utc` 屬性（一個表示 UTC 的 :class:`!"
"timezone` 實例）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2400
msgid ""
"``zoneinfo`` brings the *IANA time zone database* (also known as the Olson "
"database) to Python, and its usage is recommended."
msgstr ""
"``zoneinfo`` 將 *IANA 時區資料庫*\\ （也稱為 Olson 資料庫）帶進 Python，建議"
"使用它。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2403
msgid "`IANA time zone database <https://www.iana.org/time-zones>`_"
msgstr "`IANA 時區資料庫 <https://www.iana.org/time-zones>`_"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2404
msgid ""
"The Time Zone Database (often called tz, tzdata or zoneinfo) contains code "
"and data that represent the history of local time for many representative "
"locations around the globe. It is updated periodically to reflect changes "
"made by political bodies to time zone boundaries, UTC offsets, and daylight-"
"saving rules."
msgstr ""
"時區資料庫（常被稱為 tz、tzdata 或 zoneinfo）包含了用來表示全球許多代表性地點"
"本地時間歷史的程式碼與資料。它會定期更新，以反映政治機構對時區邊界、UTC 偏移"
"以及日光節約時間規則所做的變更。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2414
msgid ":class:`!timezone` objects"
msgstr ":class:`!timezone` 物件"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2416
msgid ""
"The :class:`timezone` class is a subclass of :class:`tzinfo`, each instance "
"of which represents a time zone defined by a fixed offset from UTC."
msgstr ""
":class:`timezone` 類別是 :class:`tzinfo` 的子類別，它的每個實例都代表一個由"
"與 UTC 的固定偏移量所定義的時區。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2420
msgid ""
"Objects of this class cannot be used to represent time zone information in "
"the locations where different offsets are used in different days of the year "
"or where historical changes have been made to civil time."
msgstr ""
"此類別的物件無法用來表示某些地點的時區資訊，也就是在一年中不同日子使用不同偏"
"移量的地點，或民用時間 (civil time) 曾有歷史變更的地點。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2427
msgid ""
"The *offset* argument must be specified as a :class:`timedelta` object "
"representing the difference between the local time and UTC. It must be "
"strictly between ``-timedelta(hours=24)`` and ``timedelta(hours=24)``, "
"otherwise :exc:`ValueError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"*offset* 引數必須指定為一個 :class:`timedelta` 物件，表示本地時間與 UTC 之間"
"的差值。它必須嚴格介於 ``-timedelta(hours=24)`` 與 ``timedelta(hours=24)`` 之"
"間，否則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2432
msgid ""
"The *name* argument is optional. If specified it must be a string that will "
"be used as the value returned by the :meth:`datetime.tzname` method."
msgstr ""
"*name* 引數是選用的。如果有指定，它必須是一個字串，並會被用作 :meth:"
"`datetime.tzname` 方法的回傳值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2443 ../../library/datetime.rst:2455
msgid ""
"Return the fixed value specified when the :class:`timezone` instance is "
"constructed."
msgstr "回傳建構 :class:`timezone` 實例時所指定的固定值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2446
msgid ""
"The *dt* argument is ignored. The return value is a :class:`timedelta` "
"instance equal to the difference between the local time and UTC."
msgstr ""
"*dt* 引數會被忽略。回傳值是一個 :class:`timedelta` 實例，其值等於本地時間與 "
"UTC 之間的差值。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2458
msgid ""
"If *name* is not provided in the constructor, the name returned by "
"``tzname(dt)`` is generated from the value of the ``offset`` as follows. If "
"*offset* is ``timedelta(0)``, the name is \"UTC\", otherwise it is a string "
"in the format ``UTC±HH:MM``, where ± is the sign of ``offset``, HH and MM "
"are two digits of ``offset.hours`` and ``offset.minutes`` respectively."
msgstr ""
"如果建構函式中沒有提供 *name*，則 ``tzname(dt)`` 回傳的名稱會依照以下方式從 "
"``offset`` 的值產生。如果 *offset* 為 ``timedelta(0)``，名稱為「UTC」，否則"
"是 ``UTC±HH:MM`` 格式的字串，其中 ± 是 ``offset`` 的正負號，HH 與 MM 分別是 "
"``offset.hours`` 與 ``offset.minutes`` 的兩位數字。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2464
msgid ""
"Name generated from ``offset=timedelta(0)`` is now plain ``'UTC'``, not "
"``'UTC+00:00'``."
msgstr ""
"由 ``offset=timedelta(0)`` 產生的名稱現在是單純的 ``'UTC'``，而不是 "
"``'UTC+00:00'``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2471
msgid "Always returns ``None``."
msgstr "總是回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2476
msgid ""
"Return ``dt + offset``. The *dt* argument must be an aware :class:`."
"datetime` instance, with ``tzinfo`` set to ``self``."
msgstr ""
"回傳 ``dt + offset``。*dt* 引數必須是一個 aware 的 :class:`.datetime` 實例，"
"且其 ``tzinfo`` 設為 ``self``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2484
msgid "The UTC time zone, ``timezone(timedelta(0))``."
msgstr "UTC 時區，``timezone(timedelta(0))``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2493
msgid ":meth:`!strftime` and :meth:`!strptime` behavior"
msgstr ":meth:`!strftime` 與 :meth:`!strptime` 的行為"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2495
msgid ""
":class:`date`, :class:`.datetime`, and :class:`.time` objects all support a "
"``strftime(format)`` method, to create a string representing the time under "
"the control of an explicit format string."
msgstr ""
":class:`date`、:class:`.datetime` 與 :class:`.time` 物件都支援 "
"``strftime(format)`` 方法，用來在明確的格式字串控制下建立表示時間的字串。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2499
