"for convenience."
msgstr "為了方便起見，另外也納入了數個 C11 標準未要求的指令。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2692
msgid "``%f``"
msgstr "``%f``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2692
msgid "Microsecond as a decimal number, zero-padded to 6 digits."
msgstr "以十進位數字表示的微秒，以零填充至 6 位數。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2692
msgid "000000, 000001, ..., 999999"
msgstr "000000, 000001, ..., 999999"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2692
msgid "\\(5)"
msgstr "\\(5)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2696 ../../library/datetime.rst:2863
msgid "``%:z``"
msgstr "``%:z``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2696
msgid ""
"UTC offset in the form ``±HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]`` (empty string if the object "
"is naive)."
msgstr ""
"格式為 ``±HH:MM[:SS[.ffffff]]`` 的 UTC 偏移（如果物件是 naive 的則為空字"
"串）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2696
msgid "(empty), +00:00, -04:00, +10:30, +06:34:15, -03:07:12.345216"
msgstr "（空）, +00:00, -04:00, +10:30, +06:34:15, -03:07:12.345216"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2702
msgid ""
"The full set of format codes supported varies across platforms, because "
"Python calls the platform C library's :c:func:`strftime` function, and "
"platform variations are common. To see the full set of format codes "
"supported on your platform, consult the :manpage:`strftime(3)` "
"documentation. There are also differences between platforms in handling of "
"unsupported format specifiers."
msgstr ""
"支援的完整格式碼集合會因平台而異，因為 Python 呼叫的是平台 C 函式庫的 :c:"
"func:`strftime` 函式，而平台之間的差異很常見。要查看你的平台所支援的完整格式"
"碼集合，請參閱 :manpage:`strftime(3)` 文件。各平台在處理不支援的格式指定符號 "
"(format specifier) 上也有所差異。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2708
msgid "``%G``, ``%u`` and ``%V`` were added."
msgstr "新增 ``%G``、``%u`` 與 ``%V``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2711
msgid "``%:z`` was added for :meth:`~.datetime.strftime`."
msgstr "為 :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 新增 ``%:z``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2714
msgid ""
"``%D``, ``%F``, ``%n``, ``%t``, and ``%:z`` were added for :meth:`~.datetime."
"strptime`."
msgstr ""
"為 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 新增 ``%D``、``%F``、``%n``、``%t`` 與 ``%:"
"z``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2720
msgid "Technical detail"
msgstr "技術細節"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2722
msgid ""
"Broadly speaking, ``d.strftime(fmt)`` acts like the :mod:`time` module's "
"``time.strftime(fmt, d.timetuple())`` although not all objects support a :"
"meth:`~date.timetuple` method."
msgstr ""
"大致來說，``d.strftime(fmt)`` 的行為就像 :mod:`time` 模組的 ``time."
"strftime(fmt, d.timetuple())``，但並非所有物件都支援 :meth:`~date.timetuple` "
"方法。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2726
msgid ""
"For the :meth:`.datetime.strptime` and :meth:`.date.strptime` class methods, "
"the default value is ``1900-01-01T00:00:00.000``: any components not "
"specified in the format string will be pulled from the default value."
msgstr ""
"對於 :meth:`.datetime.strptime` 與 :meth:`.date.strptime` 類別方法，預設值為 "
"``1900-01-01T00:00:00.000``：任何未在格式字串中指定的部分都會從預設值中取得。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2731
msgid ""
"Format strings without separators can be ambiguous for parsing. For example, "
"with ``%Y%m%d``, the string ``2026111`` may be parsed either as "
"``2026-11-01`` or as ``2026-01-11``. Use separators to ensure the input is "
"parsed as intended."
msgstr ""
"沒有分隔符號的格式字串在剖析時可能會有歧義。例如，使用 ``%Y%m%d`` 時，字串 "
"``2026111`` 可能被剖析為 ``2026-11-01`` 或 ``2026-01-11``。請使用分隔符號以確"
"保輸入按照預期被剖析。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2737
msgid ""
"When used to parse partial dates lacking a year, :meth:`.datetime.strptime` "
"and :meth:`.date.strptime` will raise when encountering February 29 because "
"the default year of 1900 is *not* a leap year.  Always add a default leap "
"year to partial date strings before parsing."
msgstr ""
"當用於剖析缺少年份的部分日期時，:meth:`.datetime.strptime` 與 :meth:`.date."
"strptime` 在遇到 2 月 29 日時會引發例外，因為預設的年份 1900 *不是*\\ 閏年。"
"在剖析之前，請一律為部分日期字串加上一個預設的閏年。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2743
msgid ""
"If a :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` format string contains more than one "
"directive for the same field, for example both ``%Y`` and ``%y``, every "
"directive must still match the input, but only the value of the last one is "
"used. For example, parsing ``200099`` with ``%Y%y`` gives the year 1999. "
"Repeating the same directive, like ``%Y%Y``, raises an error."
msgstr ""
"如果 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 的格式字串中有多個對應同一欄位的指令，例如同"
"時有 ``%Y`` 與 ``%y``，則每個指令仍都必須與輸入相符，但只會使用最後一個指令的"
"值。例如，以 ``%Y%y`` 剖析 ``200099`` 會得到 1999 年。重複使用同一個指令（例"
"如 ``%Y%Y``）則會引發錯誤。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2764
msgid ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> value = \"2/29\"\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(value, \"%m/%d\")\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"ValueError: day 29 must be in range 1..28 for month 2 in year 1900\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(f\"1904 {value}\", \"%Y %m/%d\")\n"
"datetime.datetime(1904, 2, 29, 0, 0)"
msgstr ""
">>> import datetime as dt\n"
">>> value = \"2/29\"\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(value, \"%m/%d\")\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"...\n"
"ValueError: day 29 must be in range 1..28 for month 2 in year 1900\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(f\"1904 {value}\", \"%Y %m/%d\")\n"
"datetime.datetime(1904, 2, 29, 0, 0)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2775
msgid "Using ``datetime.strptime(date_string, format)`` is equivalent to::"
msgstr "使用 ``datetime.strptime(date_string, format)`` 等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2779
msgid ""
"except when the format includes sub-second components or time zone offset "
"information, which are supported in ``datetime.strptime`` but are discarded "
"by ``time.strptime``."
msgstr ""
"但格式中包含次秒 (sub-second) 部分或時區偏移資訊時除外；``datetime."
"strptime`` 支援這些資訊，但 ``time.strptime`` 會將其捨棄。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2783
msgid ""
"For :class:`.time` objects, the format codes for year, month, and day should "
"not be used, as :class:`!time` objects have no such values. If they're used "
"anyway, 1900 is substituted for the year, and 1 for the month and day."
msgstr ""
"對 :class:`.time` 物件來說，不應該使用年、月、日的格式碼，因為 :class:`!"
"time` 物件並沒有這些值。如果使用這些格式碼，年份會以 1900 代替、月及日會以 1 "
"代替。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2787
msgid ""
"For :class:`date` objects, the format codes for hours, minutes, seconds, and "
"microseconds should not be used, as :class:`date` objects have no such "
"values. If they're used anyway, 0 is substituted for them."
msgstr ""
"對 :class:`date` 物件來說，不應該使用時、分、秒、微秒的格式碼，因為 :class:"
"`date` 物件並沒有這些值。如果使用這些格式碼，這些值都會以 0 代替。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2791
msgid ""
"For the same reason, handling of format strings containing Unicode code "
"points that can't be represented in the charset of the current locale is "
"also platform-dependent. On some platforms such code points are preserved "
"intact in the output, while on others ``strftime`` may raise :exc:"
"`UnicodeError` or return an empty string instead."
msgstr ""
"基於同樣的理由，若格式字串包含無法以目前區域設定的字元集表示的 Unicode 編碼位"
"置 (code point)，其處理方式也取決於平台。在某些平台上，這些編碼位置會在輸出中"
"原封不動地保留，而在其他平台上，``strftime`` 則可能引發 :exc:`UnicodeError` "
"或改為回傳空字串。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2800
msgid ""
"This format code is currently unsupported by :meth:`~.datetime.strptime`."
msgstr ":meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 目前不支援此格式碼。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2803
msgid ""
"Because the format depends on the current locale, care should be taken when "
"making assumptions about the output value. Field orderings will vary (for "
"example, \"month/day/year\" versus \"day/month/year\"), and the output may "
"contain non-ASCII characters."
msgstr ""
"由於格式取決於目前的區域設定，在對輸出值做假設時應該小心。欄位的順序會有所不"
"同（例如「月/日/年」與「日/月/年」），而且輸出可能包含非 ASCII 字元。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2809
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` method can parse years in the full [1, 9999] "
"range, but years < 1000 must be zero-filled to 4-digit width."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法可以剖析完整 [1, 9999] 範圍內的年份，但小於 "
"1000 的年份必須以零填充至 4 位數寬度。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2812
msgid ""
"In previous versions, :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` method was restricted to "
"years >= 1900."
msgstr ""
"在之前的版本中，:meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 方法僅限於 >= 1900 的年份。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2816
msgid ""
"In version 3.2, :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` method was restricted to years "
">= 1000."
msgstr "在 3.2 版中，:meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 方法僅限於 >= 1000 的年份。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2821
msgid ""
"When used with the :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` method, the ``%p`` directive "
"only affects the output hour field if the ``%I`` directive is used to parse "
"the hour."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法一起使用時，只有在使用 ``%I`` 指令來剖析小"
"時的情況下，``%p`` 指令才會影響輸出的小時欄位。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2825
msgid ""
"Unlike the :mod:`time` module, the :mod:`!datetime` module does not support "
"leap seconds."
msgstr "與 :mod:`time` 模組不同，:mod:`!datetime` 模組不支援閏秒。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2829
msgid ""
"When used with the :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` method, the ``%f`` directive "
"accepts from one to six digits and zero pads on the right. ``%f`` is an "
"extension to the set of format characters in the C standard (but implemented "
"separately in datetime objects, and therefore always available)."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法一起使用時，``%f`` 指令接受一到六位數字，"
"並在右側補零。``%f`` 是對 C 標準中格式字元集合的擴充（但在 datetime 物件中是"
"獨立實作的，因此總是可用）。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2836
msgid ""
"For a naive object, the ``%z``, ``%:z`` and ``%Z`` format codes are replaced "
"by empty strings."
msgstr "對於 naive 物件，``%z``、``%:z`` 與 ``%Z`` 格式碼會被替換為空字串。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2839
msgid "For an aware object:"
msgstr "對於 aware 物件："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2842
msgid ""
":meth:`~.datetime.utcoffset` is transformed into a string of the form "
"``±HHMM[SS[.ffffff]]``, where ``HH`` is a 2-digit string giving the number "
"of UTC offset hours, ``MM`` is a 2-digit string giving the number of UTC "
"offset minutes, ``SS`` is a 2-digit string giving the number of UTC offset "
"seconds and ``ffffff`` is a 6-digit string giving the number of UTC offset "
"microseconds. The ``ffffff`` part is omitted when the offset is a whole "
"number of seconds and both the ``ffffff`` and the ``SS`` part is omitted "
"when the offset is a whole number of minutes. For example, if :meth:`~."
"datetime.utcoffset` returns ``timedelta(hours=-3, minutes=-30)``, ``%z`` is "
"replaced with the string ``'-0330'``."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~.datetime.utcoffset` 會被轉換為 ``±HHMM[SS[.ffffff]]`` 形式的字串，其"
"中 ``HH`` 是表示 UTC 偏移小時數的 2 位數字串，``MM`` 是表示 UTC 偏移分鐘數的 "
"2 位數字串，``SS`` 是表示 UTC 偏移秒數的 2 位數字串，而 ``ffffff`` 是表示 "
"UTC 偏移微秒數的 6 位數字串。當偏移量為整數秒時會省略 ``ffffff`` 部分，而當偏"
"移量為整數分鐘時，``ffffff`` 與 ``SS`` 部分都會被省略。例如，如果 :meth:`~."
"datetime.utcoffset` 回傳 ``timedelta(hours=-3, minutes=-30)``，``%z`` 會被替"
"換為字串 ``'-0330'``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2856
msgid ""
"When the ``%z`` directive is provided to the  :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` "
"method, the UTC offsets can have a colon as a separator between hours, "
"minutes and seconds. For example, both ``'+010000'`` and ``'+01:00:00'`` "
"will be parsed as an offset of one hour. In addition, providing ``'Z'`` is "
"identical to ``'+00:00'``."
msgstr ""
"若傳給 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法的格式中含有 ``%z`` 指令，UTC 偏移可以"
"使用冒號作為時、分、秒之間的分隔符號。例如，``'+010000'`` 與 ``'+01:00:00'`` "
"都會被剖析為一小時的偏移量。此外，提供 ``'Z'`` 與提供 ``'+00:00'`` 相同。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2864
msgid ""
"When used with :meth:`~.datetime.strftime`, behaves exactly as ``%z``, "
"except that a colon separator is added between hours, minutes and seconds."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 一起使用時，其行為與 ``%z`` 完全相同，只是會在"
"時、分、秒之間加上冒號分隔符號。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2867
msgid ""
"When used with :meth:`~.datetime.strptime`, the UTC offset is *required* to "
"have a colon as a separator between hours, minutes and seconds. For example, "
"``'+01:00:00'`` (but *not* ``'+010000'``) will be parsed as an offset of one "
"hour. In addition, providing ``'Z'`` is identical to ``'+00:00'``."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 一起使用時，UTC 偏移\\ *必須*\\ 使用冒號作為"
"時、分、秒之間的分隔符號。例如，``'+01:00:00'``\\ （但\\ *不是* "
"``'+010000'``）會被剖析為一小時的偏移量。此外，提供 ``'Z'`` 與提供 "
"``'+00:00'`` 相同。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2874
msgid ""
"In :meth:`~.datetime.strftime`, ``%Z`` is replaced by an empty string if :"
"meth:`~.datetime.tzname` returns ``None``; otherwise ``%Z`` is replaced by "
"the returned value, which must be a string."
msgstr ""
"在 :meth:`~.datetime.strftime` 中，如果 :meth:`~.datetime.tzname` 回傳 "
"``None``，``%Z`` 會被替換為空字串；否則 ``%Z`` 會被替換為該回傳值，且該值必須"
"是字串。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2878
msgid ":meth:`~.datetime.strptime` only accepts certain values for ``%Z``:"
msgstr ":meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 只接受特定的 ``%Z`` 值："

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2880
msgid "any value in ``time.tzname`` for your machine's locale"
msgstr "你的機器的區域設定中 ``time.tzname`` 裡的任何值"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2881
msgid "the hard-coded values ``UTC`` and ``GMT``"
msgstr "寫死的值 ``UTC`` 與 ``GMT``"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2883
msgid ""
"So someone living in Japan may have ``JST``, ``UTC``, and ``GMT`` as valid "
"values, but probably not ``EST``. It will raise ``ValueError`` for invalid "
"values."
msgstr ""
"所以住在日本的人可能會有 ``JST``、``UTC`` 與 ``GMT`` 作為有效值，但大概不會"
"有 ``EST``。對於無效的值，會引發 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2887
msgid ""
"When the ``%z`` directive is provided to the :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` "
"method, an aware :class:`.datetime` object will be produced. The ``tzinfo`` "
"of the result will be set to a :class:`timezone` instance."
msgstr ""
"若傳給 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法的格式中含有 ``%z`` 指令，會產生一個 "
"aware 的 :class:`.datetime` 物件。結果的 ``tzinfo`` 會被設為一個 :class:"
"`timezone` 實例。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2893
msgid ""
"When used with the :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` method, ``%U`` and ``%W`` are "
"only used in calculations when the day of the week and the calendar year "
"(``%Y``) are specified."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法一起使用時，``%U`` 與 ``%W`` 只有在指定了"
"星期幾與日曆年 (``%Y``) 時才會用於計算。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2898
msgid ""
"Similar to ``%U`` and ``%W``, ``%V`` is only used in calculations when the "
"day of the week and the ISO year (``%G``) are specified in a :meth:`~."
"datetime.strptime` format string. Also note that ``%G`` and ``%Y`` are not "
"interchangeable."
msgstr ""
"與 ``%U`` 和 ``%W`` 類似，``%V`` 只有在 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 格式字串"
"中指定了星期幾與 ISO 年 (``%G``) 時才會用於計算。另外請注意，``%G`` 與 "
"``%Y`` 不能互換。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2904
msgid ""
"When used with the :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` method, the leading zero is "
"optional for  formats ``%d``, ``%m``, ``%H``, ``%I``, ``%M``, ``%S``, "
"``%j``, ``%U``, ``%W``, and ``%V``. Format ``%y`` does require a leading "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 方法一起使用時，格式 ``%d``、``%m``、``%H``、"
"``%I``、``%M``、``%S``、``%j``、``%U``、``%W`` 與 ``%V`` 的前導零是選用的。格"
"式 ``%y`` 則需要前導零。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2909
msgid ""
"When parsing a month and day using :meth:`~.datetime.strptime`, always "
"include a year in the format.  If the value you need to parse lacks a year, "
"append an explicit dummy leap year.  Otherwise your code will raise an "
"exception when it encounters leap day because the default year used by the "
"parser (1900) is not a leap year.  Users run into that bug every leap year."
msgstr ""
"使用 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 剖析月份與日期時，請一律在格式中包含年份。如"
"果你需要剖析的值缺少年份，請附加一個明確的虛設閏年。否則你的程式碼在遇到閏日"
"時會引發例外，因為剖析器使用的預設年份 (1900) 不是閏年。每逢閏年都會有使用者"
"遇到這個 bug。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2915
msgid ""
">>> month_day = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(f\"{month_day};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # No leap "
"year bug.\n"
"datetime.datetime(1984, 2, 29, 0, 0)"
msgstr ""
">>> month_day = \"02/29\"\n"
">>> dt.datetime.strptime(f\"{month_day};1984\", \"%m/%d;%Y\")  # 沒有閏年問"
"題。\n"
"datetime.datetime(1984, 2, 29, 0, 0)"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2921
msgid "Using ``%d`` without a year now raises :exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr "現在使用 ``%d`` 卻沒有指定年份時會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2924
msgid ""
":meth:`~.datetime.strptime` calls using a format string containing ``%e`` "
"without a year now emit a :exc:`DeprecationWarning`."
msgstr ""
"現在以包含 ``%e`` 但沒有年份的格式字串呼叫 :meth:`~.datetime.strptime` 時，會"
"發出 :exc:`DeprecationWarning`。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2929
msgid "Footnotes"
msgstr "註腳"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2930
msgid "If, that is, we ignore the effects of relativity."
msgstr "也就是說，我們會忽略相對論的效應。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2932
msgid ""
"This matches the definition of the \"proleptic Gregorian\" calendar in "
"Dershowitz and Reingold's book *Calendrical Calculations*, where it's the "
"base calendar for all computations. See the book for algorithms for "
"converting between proleptic Gregorian ordinals and many other calendar "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"這符合 Dershowitz 與 Reingold 的著作 *Calendrical Calculations* 中「逆推公"
"曆」(proleptic Gregorian) 的定義，該曆法是書中所有計算的基礎曆法。關於在逆推"
"公曆序數與許多其他曆法系統之間轉換的演算法，請參閱該書。"

#: ../../library/datetime.rst:2938
msgid ""
"See R. H. van Gent's `guide to the mathematics of the ISO 8601 calendar "
"<https://web.archive.org/web/20220531051136/https://webspace.science.uu.nl/"
"~gent0113/calendar/isocalendar.htm>`_ for a good explanation."
msgstr ""
"關於 ISO 8601 曆法的良好解說，請參閱 R. H. van Gent 的 `ISO 8601 曆法數學指"
"南 <https://web.archive.org/web/20220531051136/https://webspace.science.uu."
"nl/~gent0113/calendar/isocalendar.htm>`_。"

